window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":6,"en":"Education & Learning","zh":"教育與學習","items":[{"w":"kindergarten","pos":"n.","def":"a school for children aged about three to six","cn":"幼兒園","s":"My little brother started ________ last September, and now he sings English songs at home every evening.","zh":"我弟弟去年九月開始上幼兒園，現在他每天晚上都在家唱英文歌。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A1","t":"幼兒園"},{"w":"preschool","pos":"n.","def":"a school for young children before primary school","cn":"學前教育機構；幼稚園","s":"Many parents in Taipei send their children to a bilingual ________ because they want them to learn English early.","zh":"台北許多家長把孩子送到雙語幼稚園，因為他們希望孩子及早學英文。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A2","t":"幼稚園"},{"w":"elementary","pos":"adj.","def":"about the first, simplest stage of school or learning","cn":"初級的；小學的","s":"My cousin teaches at an ________ school in Tainan, and she says the children are full of energy every morning.","zh":"我表姊在台南一所小學教書，她說孩子們每天早上都精力充沛。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A3","t":"小學"},{"w":"boarding school","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a school where students live and sleep during the term","cn":"寄宿學校","s":"Jason was nervous about moving to a ______ ______ in the mountains, but he soon made friends in his dormitory.","zh":"傑森對於搬到山上的寄宿學校感到緊張，但他很快就在宿舍交到了朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A4","t":"寄宿學校"},{"w":"headteacher","pos":"n.","def":"the teacher who is in charge of a school","cn":"校長","s":"The ________ gave a short speech at the start of the year, and she asked every student to try something new.","zh":"校長在學年開始時做了簡短的演講，她要求每位學生嘗試一件新事物。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A5","t":"校長"},{"w":"classmate","pos":"n.","def":"a person in the same class as you at school","cn":"同班同學","s":"I forgot my calculator before the maths test, so my ________ kindly lent me hers for the whole lesson.","zh":"我在數學考試前忘了帶計算機，所以我的同學好心地把她的借我用了一整節課。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A6","t":"同學"},{"w":"playground","pos":"n.","def":"an outdoor area at school where children play","cn":"遊樂場；操場","s":"The younger pupils rushed to the ________ as soon as the bell rang, and they played until lunch was ready.","zh":"鐘聲一響，低年級學生就衝到操場，一直玩到午餐準備好。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A7","t":"操場"},{"w":"cafeteria","pos":"n.","def":"a place in a school where students buy and eat food","cn":"自助餐廳；學生餐廳","s":"The school ________ now offers more vegetables and fruit, but some students still prefer fried chicken and bubble tea.","zh":"學校餐廳現在提供更多蔬菜和水果，但有些學生還是比較喜歡炸雞和珍珠奶茶。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A8","t":"餐廳"},{"w":"locker","pos":"n.","def":"a small metal cupboard where students keep their things","cn":"置物櫃","s":"I left my heavy dictionary in my ________ after class, so my backpack felt much lighter on the way home.","zh":"我下課後把厚重的字典留在置物櫃裡，所以回家路上背包輕多了。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A9","t":"置物櫃"},{"w":"dormitory","pos":"n.","def":"a large building where students live and sleep","cn":"宿舍","s":"The ________ lights go off at eleven o'clock, so students who want to keep studying have to use small desk lamps.","zh":"宿舍的燈十一點就熄了，所以想繼續讀書的學生只能用小檯燈。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A10","t":"宿舍"},{"w":"semester","pos":"n.","def":"one of the two main periods in a school year","cn":"學期","s":"This ________ I am taking an extra Japanese class, but I still have time to play basketball on Fridays.","zh":"這學期我多修了一堂日文課，但我星期五仍然有時間打籃球。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A11","t":"學期"},{"w":"recess","pos":"n.","def":"a short break between lessons at school","cn":"下課時間","s":"During morning ________ the students bought snacks at the school shop, and some of them finished their reading homework.","zh":"在早上的下課時間，學生們到福利社買零食，其中有些人寫完了閱讀作業。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A12","t":"下課時間"},{"w":"attendance","pos":"n.","def":"how often someone is present at school or class","cn":"出席；出席率","s":"Her ________ was almost perfect this year, because she only missed one day when she had a bad cold.","zh":"她今年的出席率幾乎是完美的，因為她只有在重感冒時缺席了一天。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A13","t":"出席率"},{"w":"absent","pos":"adj.","def":"not at school or work when you should be","cn":"缺席的","s":"Three students were ________ on Monday because of the flu, so the teacher decided to postpone the speaking test.","zh":"星期一有三位學生因為流感而缺席，所以老師決定延後口說測驗。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A14","t":"缺席"},{"w":"truancy","pos":"n.","def":"staying away from school without permission","cn":"逃學；曠課","s":"The school called his parents about his ________, and they were shocked because he had left home every morning in uniform.","zh":"學校打電話給他的父母談他逃學的事，他們很震驚，因為他每天早上都穿著制服出門。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A15","t":"逃學"},{"w":"expel","pos":"v.","def":"to officially make a student leave a school","cn":"開除；退學","s":"The school may ________ any student who brings a weapon to class, so the rules are explained clearly on the first day.","zh":"學校可能會開除任何帶武器到班上的學生，所以第一天就會清楚說明規定。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A16","t":"開除"},{"w":"detention","pos":"n.","def":"a punishment where a student must stay after school","cn":"課後留校（處罰）","s":"Ken talked loudly during the test, so he got an hour of ________ and missed his football practice.","zh":"肯在考試時大聲講話，所以被罰課後留校一小時，錯過了足球練習。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A17","t":"課後留校"},{"w":"punctual","pos":"adj.","def":"arriving or doing something at the right time","cn":"準時的","s":"Our English teacher is always ________, and she expects us to be in our seats before the bell rings.","zh":"我們的英文老師總是很準時，她也要求我們在鐘響前坐到座位上。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A18","t":"準時"},{"w":"extracurricular","pos":"adj.","def":"done at school but not part of normal lessons","cn":"課外的","s":"Universities like applicants who join ________ activities, because these activities show teamwork and leadership skills.","zh":"大學喜歡參加課外活動的申請者，因為這些活動能展現團隊合作和領導能力。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A19","t":"課外"},{"w":"field trip","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a visit made by students to learn outside school","cn":"校外教學","s":"Our class went on a ______ ______ to the science museum, and we watched a show about volcanoes and earthquakes.","zh":"我們班去科學博物館校外教學，還觀看了一場關於火山和地震的表演。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A20","t":"校外教學"},{"w":"assembly","pos":"n.","def":"a meeting of all the students and teachers in a school","cn":"朝會；集會","s":"Every Monday morning the whole school gathers for ________, and the student council shares important news.","zh":"每個星期一早上全校都會集合參加朝會，學生會在會中分享重要消息。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A21","t":"朝會"},{"w":"orientation","pos":"n.","def":"a time of introduction for new students","cn":"新生訓練；入門介紹","s":"New students attended a two-day ________ before classes began, so they knew where the library and labs were.","zh":"新生在開學前參加了兩天的新生訓練，所以他們知道圖書館和實驗室在哪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A22","t":"新生訓練"},{"w":"alumni","pos":"n.","def":"former students of a school or university","cn":"校友（複數）","s":"Several famous ________ came back to give talks on career day, and the students asked them many questions.","zh":"幾位知名校友在職涯日回校演講，學生們問了他們很多問題。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A23","t":"校友"},{"w":"homeroom","pos":"n.","def":"the class where students meet their main teacher each day","cn":"導師班；班級教室","s":"Our ________ teacher checks attendance every morning, and she also helps us when we have problems with friends.","zh":"我們的導師每天早上點名，而且在我們和朋友有問題時也會幫助我們。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A24","t":"導師"},{"w":"bully","pos":"v.","def":"to hurt or frighten someone weaker again and again","cn":"霸凌；欺負","s":"Some older boys used to ________ him online, but he told a teacher and the school stopped it quickly.","zh":"有些年紀較大的男孩過去常在網路上霸凌他，但他告訴了老師，學校很快就制止了。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A25","t":"霸凌"},{"w":"classroom","pos":"n.","def":"a room where lessons take place","cn":"教室","s":"Our ________ has new air conditioners this year, so it is much easier to concentrate on hot afternoons.","zh":"我們的教室今年裝了新冷氣，所以在炎熱的下午專心上課容易多了。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A26","t":"教室"},{"w":"stationery","pos":"n.","def":"pens, paper, rulers and other things for writing","cn":"文具","s":"Before the new semester, students crowd into ________ shops, and they buy colourful pens, notebooks and sticky notes.","zh":"新學期開始前，學生們擠進文具店，買彩色筆、筆記本和便利貼。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A27","t":"文具"},{"w":"staffroom","pos":"n.","def":"a room in a school where teachers work and rest","cn":"教師辦公室","s":"I took my test paper to the ________ after lunch, because I wanted to ask my teacher about one question.","zh":"午餐後我把考卷拿到教師辦公室，因為我想問老師其中一題。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A28","t":"教師辦公室"},{"w":"co-educational","pos":"adj.","def":"for both boys and girls together","cn":"男女合校的","s":"Most high schools in Taiwan are now ________, but some traditional schools still accept only boys or only girls.","zh":"台灣大多數高中現在都是男女合校，但有些傳統學校仍然只收男生或只收女生。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A29","t":"男女合校"},{"w":"single-sex","pos":"adj.","def":"only for boys or only for girls","cn":"單一性別的","s":"My mother studied at a ________ school for girls, and she says it helped her feel confident in science classes.","zh":"我媽媽以前就讀一所單一性別的女校，她說那幫助她在科學課上更有自信。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A30","t":"單一性別"},{"w":"state school","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a school paid for by the government","cn":"公立學校","s":"In Britain most children go to a ______ ______, while a small number of families pay for private education.","zh":"在英國大部分孩子就讀公立學校，而少數家庭則花錢讓孩子接受私立教育。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A31","t":"公立學校"},{"w":"janitor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who cleans and looks after a school building","cn":"校工；工友","s":"The ________ fixed the broken window before school started, so our lesson was not interrupted by the cold wind.","zh":"工友在上課前修好了破掉的窗戶，所以我們上課沒有被冷風打擾。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A32","t":"工友"},{"w":"dress code","pos":"n.phr.","def":"rules about what clothes people may wear","cn":"服裝規定","s":"The school relaxed its ______ ______ last year, so students can now wear sports clothes on hot days.","zh":"學校去年放寬了服裝規定，所以學生現在天氣熱時可以穿運動服。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A33","t":"服裝規定"},{"w":"reunion","pos":"n.","def":"a meeting of people who have not seen each other for a long time","cn":"重聚；同學會","s":"My father went to his high school ________ last weekend, and he was surprised that many classmates had become teachers.","zh":"我爸爸上週末去參加高中同學會，他很驚訝許多同學都成了老師。","part":"A","sec":"Schools & School Life 學校與校園生活","lab":"A34","t":"同學會"},{"w":"pedagogy","pos":"n.","def":"the methods and practice of teaching","cn":"教學法","s":"The new teacher studied modern ________ at university, so she uses games and discussions instead of just talking for an hour.","zh":"這位新老師在大學研讀過現代教學法，所以她用遊戲和討論，而不是只講課一個小時。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A35","t":"教學法"},{"w":"educator","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is teaching or education","cn":"教育工作者","s":"Many ________ in Taiwan are trying new methods, but they still need time and support from their schools.","zh":"台灣許多教育工作者正在嘗試新方法，但他們仍然需要學校給予時間和支持。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A36","t":"教育工作者"},{"w":"instructor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who teaches a practical skill","cn":"教練；講師","s":"My swimming ________ is very patient, and she never shouts when I make the same mistake again.","zh":"我的游泳教練非常有耐心，即使我再犯同樣的錯誤，她也從不大吼。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A37","t":"教練"},{"w":"lesson plan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a teacher's written plan for one class","cn":"教案","s":"Ms Lin writes a detailed ______ ______ for every class, but she changes it when the students need more practice.","zh":"林老師每堂課都會寫詳細的教案，但當學生需要更多練習時她會調整。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A38","t":"教案"},{"w":"worksheet","pos":"n.","def":"a paper with exercises for students to complete","cn":"學習單","s":"The teacher handed out a ________ about the reading passage, and we had ten minutes to answer the questions in pairs.","zh":"老師發下一張關於閱讀文章的學習單，我們有十分鐘兩人一組回答問題。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A39","t":"學習單"},{"w":"handout","pos":"n.","def":"a sheet of information given to students in class","cn":"講義","s":"Please keep this ________ in your folder, because it has all the grammar rules that will be on the test.","zh":"請把這份講義收在你的資料夾裡，因為上面有所有會考的文法規則。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A40","t":"講義"},{"w":"whiteboard","pos":"n.","def":"a white board that teachers write on with markers","cn":"白板","s":"The teacher drew a timeline on the ________, and the students copied it carefully into their notebooks.","zh":"老師在白板上畫了一條時間軸，學生們仔細地把它抄進筆記本。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A41","t":"白板"},{"w":"projector","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that shows pictures or slides on a screen","cn":"投影機","s":"The ________ stopped working in the middle of my presentation, so I had to explain my ideas without any slides.","zh":"投影機在我報告到一半時壞了，所以我只好在沒有投影片的情況下解釋我的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A42","t":"投影機"},{"w":"group work","pos":"n.phr.","def":"tasks that students do together in small teams","cn":"小組作業；分組活動","s":"Some students enjoy ______ ______, but others feel that one or two members always do most of the job.","zh":"有些學生喜歡分組活動，但也有人覺得總是一兩位組員做了大部分的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A43","t":"分組活動"},{"w":"seminar","pos":"n.","def":"a small class where students discuss a subject with a teacher","cn":"研討課；專題討論","s":"In the weekly ________ each student shares an article, and the others ask questions about it.","zh":"在每週的專題討論課中，每位學生分享一篇文章，其他人則針對它提問。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A44","t":"專題討論課"},{"w":"tutorial","pos":"n.","def":"a short lesson for one student or a small group","cn":"個別指導課；教學影片","s":"I watched an online ________ about using spreadsheets, and then I finally finished my science report.","zh":"我看了一段關於使用試算表的線上教學影片，然後終於完成了我的科學報告。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A45","t":"教學影片"},{"w":"role-play","pos":"n.","def":"an activity where students act as other people","cn":"角色扮演","s":"We did a ________ about ordering food in a restaurant, and it helped shy students speak more English.","zh":"我們做了一個在餐廳點餐的角色扮演，它幫助害羞的學生說更多英文。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A46","t":"角色扮演"},{"w":"presentation","pos":"n.","def":"a talk in which someone shows and explains information","cn":"簡報；口頭報告","s":"I practised my ________ in front of a mirror many times, so I felt much calmer when I spoke to the class.","zh":"我對著鏡子練習口頭報告很多次，所以向全班說話時我覺得冷靜多了。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A47","t":"口頭報告"},{"w":"brainstorm","pos":"v.","def":"to share many ideas quickly in a group","cn":"腦力激盪","s":"Before writing, the students ________ ideas about their dream school, and the teacher wrote every idea on the board.","zh":"寫作前，學生們針對理想中的學校腦力激盪，老師把每個想法都寫在黑板上。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A48","t":"腦力激盪"},{"w":"hands-on","pos":"adj.","def":"learning by doing things yourself","cn":"動手做的；實作的","s":"The science class is very ________, because we build simple machines instead of only reading about them.","zh":"這堂科學課非常注重實作，因為我們親手製作簡單機械，而不只是讀有關它們的內容。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A49","t":"注重實作"},{"w":"learner-centred","pos":"adj.","def":"focusing on what students need and do","cn":"以學習者為中心的","s":"In a ________ classroom students ask more questions, while the teacher guides them rather than gives long talks.","zh":"在以學習者為中心的教室裡，學生提出更多問題，而老師是引導他們，而不是長篇講課。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A50","t":"以學習者為中心"},{"w":"teacher-centred","pos":"adj.","def":"focusing mainly on the teacher talking and controlling","cn":"以教師為中心的","s":"Old-fashioned lessons were often ________, and students simply listened and copied notes for most of the class.","zh":"傳統的課堂常常是以教師為中心的，學生大部分時間只是聽講和抄筆記。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A51","t":"以教師為中心"},{"w":"classroom management","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the ways a teacher keeps a class organised and calm","cn":"班級經營","s":"Good ______ ______ makes lessons run smoothly, and new teachers often learn it from experienced colleagues.","zh":"良好的班級經營讓課程進行順利，新老師常從資深同事那裡學習。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A52","t":"班級經營"},{"w":"discipline","pos":"n.","def":"training people to obey rules and control behaviour","cn":"紀律；管教","s":"The coach believes in strict ________, so players who arrive late have to run extra laps.","zh":"教練相信嚴格的紀律，所以遲到的球員必須多跑幾圈。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A53","t":"紀律"},{"w":"flipped classroom","pos":"n.phr.","def":"students watch lessons at home and practise in class","cn":"翻轉教室","s":"In a ______ ______ we watch short videos at home, and then we use class time for projects and questions.","zh":"在翻轉教室裡，我們在家看短片，然後把上課時間用來做專題和提問。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A54","t":"翻轉教室"},{"w":"inquiry-based","pos":"adj.","def":"learning by asking questions and finding answers","cn":"探究式的","s":"Our school uses ________ learning in science, so students design their own experiments to test ideas.","zh":"我們學校在科學課採用探究式學習，所以學生自己設計實驗來驗證想法。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A55","t":"探究式"},{"w":"project-based","pos":"adj.","def":"learning through long practical projects","cn":"專題式的","s":"The ________ course asked us to plan a school garden, and we learned maths, science and teamwork at the same time.","zh":"這門專題式課程要我們規劃一座校園花園，而我們同時學到了數學、科學和團隊合作。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A56","t":"專題式"},{"w":"rubric","pos":"n.","def":"a chart that explains how work will be scored","cn":"評分規準","s":"The teacher gave us the ________ before we started writing, so we knew exactly how our stories would be marked.","zh":"老師在我們開始寫作前就給了評分規準，所以我們清楚知道故事會如何被評分。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A57","t":"評分規準"},{"w":"pace","pos":"n.","def":"the speed at which something happens","cn":"速度；步調","s":"The teacher explained the new grammar at a slow ________, because many students had never seen it before.","zh":"老師用緩慢的速度解釋新文法，因為許多學生以前從未見過。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A58","t":"速度"},{"w":"recap","pos":"v.","def":"to repeat the main points briefly","cn":"扼要重述","s":"At the end of each lesson the teacher asks one student to ________ the key ideas, and the others add anything missing.","zh":"每堂課結束時，老師會請一位學生扼要重述重點，其他人再補充遺漏的部分。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A59","t":"扼要重述"},{"w":"rapport","pos":"n.","def":"a friendly relationship of trust and understanding","cn":"融洽關係","s":"Mr Wang has a great ________ with his students, so they feel comfortable asking him about anything.","zh":"王老師和學生之間關係非常融洽，所以他們什麼事都敢問他。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A60","t":"融洽"},{"w":"visual aid","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a picture, chart or object that helps people understand","cn":"視覺輔助教具","s":"Maps and photos are useful ______ ______, because they help students remember new words more easily.","zh":"地圖和照片是很有用的視覺輔助教具，因為它們幫助學生更容易記住新單字。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A61","t":"視覺輔助教具"},{"w":"blended learning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a mix of online learning and classroom teaching","cn":"混成學習","s":"Since the pandemic many schools use ______ ______, and students do some lessons online and some in class.","zh":"自從疫情以來，許多學校採用混成學習，學生有些課在線上上，有些在教室上。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A62","t":"混成學習"},{"w":"student teacher","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who is training to become a teacher","cn":"實習教師","s":"A ______ ______ joined our class for six weeks, and she taught us some fun songs about grammar.","zh":"一位實習老師來我們班六週，她教了我們一些有趣的文法歌。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A63","t":"實習老師"},{"w":"teaching assistant","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who helps a teacher in class","cn":"助教","s":"The ______ ______ helps students who fall behind, while the main teacher works with the rest of the class.","zh":"助教協助進度落後的學生，而主要老師則帶領班上其他同學。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A64","t":"助教"},{"w":"drill","pos":"n.","def":"practice by repeating the same exercise many times","cn":"反覆練習","s":"We did a pronunciation ________ for ten minutes, and by the end everyone could say \"th\" correctly.","zh":"我們做了十分鐘的發音反覆練習，到最後每個人都能正確發出 th 的音。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A65","t":"反覆練習"},{"w":"dictation","pos":"n.","def":"writing down words that someone reads aloud","cn":"聽寫","s":"Every Friday we have a spelling ________, so I review the new words on the bus every Thursday night.","zh":"每個星期五我們有拼字聽寫，所以我每週四晚上都在公車上複習新單字。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A66","t":"聽寫"},{"w":"spoon-feed","pos":"v.","def":"to give students answers so they do not think for themselves","cn":"填鴨式餵答案；過度灌輸","s":"Some tutors ________ students with model answers, but this does not teach them how to solve new problems.","zh":"有些補習老師用範本答案填鴨學生，但這並不能教會他們如何解決新問題。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A67","t":"填鴨"},{"w":"role model","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person whose behaviour others want to copy","cn":"榜樣；模範","s":"My aunt is my ______ ______, because she became a doctor while helping her family run a small shop.","zh":"我阿姨是我的榜樣，因為她一邊幫家裡經營小店一邊成為了醫生。","part":"A","sec":"Teaching & Classroom Practice 教學與課堂實務","lab":"A68","t":"榜樣"},{"w":"note-taking","pos":"n.","def":"writing down the key points while listening or reading","cn":"做筆記","s":"Good ________ helps you remember a lecture, but you should also read your notes again within a day.","zh":"良好的做筆記技巧能幫你記住一堂課，但你也應該在一天內重讀筆記。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A69","t":"做筆記"},{"w":"underline","pos":"v.","def":"to draw a line under words to show they are important","cn":"在…底下畫線","s":"When I read a hard article, I ________ the main ideas, and then I write a short summary in the margin.","zh":"讀困難的文章時，我會在主要概念底下畫線，然後在頁邊寫一段簡短摘要。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A70","t":"底下畫線"},{"w":"skim","pos":"v.","def":"to read something quickly to get the main idea","cn":"略讀","s":"First ________ the passage to understand the topic, and then read the questions before you look for details.","zh":"先略讀文章以了解主題，然後在找細節之前先讀題目。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A71","t":"略讀"},{"w":"scan","pos":"v.","def":"to look quickly through a text for a particular piece of information","cn":"掃讀；瀏覽搜尋","s":"I ________ the timetable for the date of the exam, but I could not find it anywhere on the page.","zh":"我快速瀏覽時刻表尋找考試日期，但在整頁上都找不到。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A72","t":"快速瀏覽"},{"w":"memorise","pos":"v.","def":"to learn something so well that you can remember it exactly","cn":"背誦；記住","s":"She tried to ________ fifty words in one night, but she forgot most of them by the next morning.","zh":"她試著在一個晚上背五十個單字，但到隔天早上就忘了大部分。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A73","t":"背"},{"w":"review","pos":"v.","def":"to study something again in order to remember it","cn":"複習","s":"I ________ my notes for ten minutes every evening, so I do not have to stay up late before tests.","zh":"我每天晚上複習筆記十分鐘，所以考試前不必熬夜。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A74","t":"複習"},{"w":"flashcard","pos":"n.","def":"a small card with a word on one side and its meaning on the other","cn":"單字卡；閃卡","s":"My sister makes a ________ for every new word, and she tests herself while she waits for the bus.","zh":"我妹妹為每個新單字做一張單字卡，並在等公車時自我測驗。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A75","t":"單字卡"},{"w":"mind map","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a diagram that connects ideas around a central topic","cn":"心智圖","s":"Before writing my essay I drew a ______ ______, and it helped me organise my ideas into three clear paragraphs.","zh":"寫作文前我畫了一張心智圖，它幫助我把想法整理成三個清楚的段落。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A76","t":"心智圖"},{"w":"study group","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small group of students who learn together","cn":"讀書會","s":"We formed a ______ ______ before the final exams, and we met in the library every Saturday afternoon.","zh":"我們在期末考前組了一個讀書會，每個星期六下午在圖書館見面。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A77","t":"讀書會"},{"w":"self-study","pos":"n.","def":"learning by yourself without a teacher","cn":"自學；自修","s":"The school gives seniors two hours of ________ every afternoon, but some students just chat with friends.","zh":"學校每天下午給高三學生兩小時自修時間，但有些學生只是和朋友聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A78","t":"自修"},{"w":"self-directed","pos":"adj.","def":"controlled and planned by the learner themselves","cn":"自主的；自我導向的","s":"Taiwan's new curriculum encourages ________ learning, so students choose a topic and plan their own research.","zh":"台灣的新課綱鼓勵自主學習，所以學生自己選擇主題並規劃研究。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A79","t":"自主"},{"w":"learning style","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way a person learns best","cn":"學習風格","s":"Some people say each child has one ______ ______, but many researchers believe we all learn in mixed ways.","zh":"有些人說每個孩子都有一種學習風格，但許多研究者認為我們都以混合的方式學習。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A80","t":"學習風格"},{"w":"kinaesthetic","pos":"adj.","def":"learning by moving and touching things","cn":"動覺的；肢體操作的","s":"My brother is a ________ learner, so he remembers science better when he builds models with his hands.","zh":"我弟弟是動覺型學習者，所以他親手做模型時對科學記得更牢。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A81","t":"動覺型"},{"w":"time management","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the skill of planning and using your time well","cn":"時間管理","s":"Good ______ ______ is important in senior high school, because students have many tests and club activities.","zh":"良好的時間管理在高中很重要，因為學生有許多考試和社團活動。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A82","t":"時間管理"},{"w":"proofread","pos":"v.","def":"to read writing carefully to find and correct mistakes","cn":"校對","s":"Always ________ your report before you hand it in, because small spelling mistakes can make a bad impression.","zh":"交報告前務必要校對，因為小小的拼字錯誤可能會給人不好的印象。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A83","t":"校對"},{"w":"dictionary","pos":"n.","def":"a book or app that explains the meanings of words","cn":"字典","s":"I checked the word in an online ________, and I also listened to its pronunciation several times.","zh":"我在線上字典查了這個字，還聽了好幾次它的發音。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A84","t":"字典"},{"w":"glossary","pos":"n.","def":"a list of difficult words with their meanings, often at the end of a book","cn":"詞彙表","s":"The biology book has a ________ at the back, so students can quickly look up difficult terms.","zh":"這本生物書後面附有詞彙表，所以學生能快速查找困難的術語。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A85","t":"詞彙表"},{"w":"bibliography","pos":"n.","def":"a list of books and articles used in a piece of writing","cn":"參考書目","s":"Our teacher reminded us to include a ________, because we must show where all our information came from.","zh":"老師提醒我們要附上參考書目，因為我們必須說明所有資訊的來源。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A86","t":"參考書目"},{"w":"librarian","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works in a library","cn":"圖書館員","s":"The ________ helped me find three useful books on Taiwanese history, and she showed me how to use the online catalogue.","zh":"圖書館員幫我找到三本有關台灣歷史的實用書籍，還教我如何使用線上目錄。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A87","t":"圖書館員"},{"w":"reading list","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a list of books students are told to read","cn":"書單；閱讀清單","s":"The summer ______ ______ includes five English novels, but students only need to write a report on one of them.","zh":"暑假書單包含五本英文小說，但學生只需要針對其中一本寫報告。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A88","t":"書單"},{"w":"grasp","pos":"v.","def":"to understand something, especially something difficult","cn":"理解；領會","s":"At first I could not ________ how the past perfect works, but my teacher's timeline made it clear.","zh":"一開始我無法理解過去完成式怎麼用，但老師畫的時間軸讓它變清楚了。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A89","t":"理解"},{"w":"master","pos":"v.","def":"to learn something completely and become very good at it","cn":"精通；掌握","s":"It takes years to ________ a musical instrument, so you should not give up after only a few lessons.","zh":"要精通一種樂器需要好幾年，所以不應該只上幾堂課就放棄。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A90","t":"精通"},{"w":"familiarise","pos":"v.","def":"to learn about something so that you know it well","cn":"使熟悉","s":"New students should ________ themselves with the school rules, because teachers will not accept excuses later.","zh":"新生應該熟悉校規，因為之後老師不會接受任何藉口。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A91","t":"熟悉"},{"w":"practise","pos":"v.","def":"to do something again and again to improve","cn":"練習","s":"I ________ speaking English with a language partner online, and my confidence has grown a lot this year.","zh":"我在線上和語言夥伴練習說英文，今年我的自信心增加了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A92","t":"練習"},{"w":"metacognition","pos":"n.","def":"thinking about how you think and learn","cn":"後設認知","s":"Teachers want to develop students' ________, so they ask them to explain how they solved each problem.","zh":"老師們想培養學生的後設認知，所以會請他們說明自己如何解出每個問題。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A93","t":"後設認知"},{"w":"studious","pos":"adj.","def":"spending a lot of time studying and reading","cn":"好學的；用功的","s":"Ben is very ________ and often reads in the library, but he also enjoys playing basketball with friends.","zh":"班非常用功，常在圖書館讀書，但他也喜歡和朋友打籃球。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A94","t":"用功"},{"w":"bookworm","pos":"n.","def":"a person who loves reading books","cn":"書蟲","s":"My best friend is a real ________, and she finished the whole Harry Potter series in two weeks.","zh":"我最好的朋友是個十足的書蟲，她兩週就讀完了整套哈利波特。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A95","t":"書蟲"},{"w":"learning curve","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how quickly someone learns something new","cn":"學習曲線","s":"Coding has a steep ______ ______ at first, but it becomes much easier after a few weeks of practice.","zh":"寫程式一開始的學習曲線很陡峭，但練習幾週之後就容易多了。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A96","t":"學習曲線"},{"w":"plateau","pos":"n.","def":"a period when progress stops for a while","cn":"停滯期；高原期","s":"Many language learners reach a ________ after a year, so they need new challenges to keep improving.","zh":"許多語言學習者在一年後會進入停滯期，所以他們需要新挑戰才能持續進步。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A97","t":"停滯期"},{"w":"annotate","pos":"v.","def":"to add short notes to a text to explain or comment","cn":"加註解","s":"We ________ the poem with our own comments, and then we compared our ideas in small groups.","zh":"我們在詩上加了自己的註解，然後在小組中比較彼此的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A98","t":"加了 註解"},{"w":"highlighter","pos":"n.","def":"a bright pen used to mark important words","cn":"螢光筆","s":"He used a yellow ________ on almost every line, so the colour no longer showed what was really important.","zh":"他幾乎每一行都用黃色螢光筆畫，所以顏色已經無法顯示真正重要的內容。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A99","t":"螢光筆"},{"w":"audiobook","pos":"n.","def":"a recording of someone reading a book aloud","cn":"有聲書","s":"I listen to an English ________ on my way to school, and it has improved my listening skills.","zh":"我上學途中聽英文有聲書，它提升了我的聽力。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A100","t":"有聲書"},{"w":"self-taught","pos":"adj.","def":"having learned a skill by yourself, without lessons","cn":"自學的","s":"The ________ guitarist never took a single lesson, but he learned hundreds of songs from online videos.","zh":"這位自學的吉他手從沒上過一堂課，但他從網路影片學會了好幾百首歌。","part":"A","sec":"Learning Skills & Study Habits 學習技巧與讀書習慣","lab":"A101","t":"自學"},{"w":"exam","pos":"n.","def":"a formal test of knowledge or skill","cn":"考試","s":"The final ________ is next Tuesday, so the library will stay open until ten o'clock every night this week.","zh":"期末考試在下週二，所以這週圖書館每晚都會開到十點。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A102","t":"考試"},{"w":"examiner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who sets or marks an exam, or tests speaking","cn":"主考官；閱卷人","s":"The IELTS ________ asked me about my hometown, and I tried to give long answers with examples.","zh":"雅思主考官問我關於家鄉的問題，我試著用例子給出較長的回答。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A103","t":"主考官"},{"w":"invigilator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who watches students during an exam","cn":"監考人員","s":"The ________ walked slowly around the hall, and she collected all the phones before the test began.","zh":"監考人員在考場裡慢慢走動，並在考試開始前收走所有手機。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A104","t":"監考人員"},{"w":"candidate","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is taking an exam","cn":"考生；應試者","s":"Each ________ must bring an ID card to the test centre, or they will not be allowed to enter the room.","zh":"每位考生都必須攜帶身分證到考場，否則將不被允許進入考場。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A105","t":"考生"},{"w":"mock exam","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a practice exam taken before the real one","cn":"模擬考","s":"My score on the ______ ______ was disappointing, but it showed me exactly which topics I needed to review.","zh":"我模擬考的成績令人失望，但它讓我清楚知道需要複習哪些主題。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A106","t":"模擬考"},{"w":"past paper","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an exam from a previous year used for practice","cn":"考古題","s":"Our teacher gave us a ______ ______ from 2023, and we did it under real time limits in class.","zh":"老師給了我們一份2023年的考古題，我們在課堂上依照真實的時間限制作答。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A107","t":"考古題"},{"w":"multiple-choice","pos":"adj.","def":"giving several possible answers to choose from","cn":"選擇題的","s":"The first part of the test has forty ________ questions, while the second part asks students to write short answers.","zh":"測驗第一部分有四十題選擇題，而第二部分要學生寫簡答。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A108","t":"選擇題"},{"w":"open-book","pos":"adj.","def":"allowing students to use books during the exam","cn":"開書考的","s":"The history test was ________, but it was still difficult because the questions asked for our own opinions.","zh":"這次歷史考試是開書考，但仍然很難，因為題目要求我們提出自己的看法。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A109","t":"開書考"},{"w":"oral","pos":"adj.","def":"spoken rather than written","cn":"口語的；口試的","s":"I was nervous before the ________ exam, but the teacher smiled and asked easy questions at first.","zh":"口試前我很緊張，但老師面帶微笑，一開始問的是簡單的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A110","t":"口試"},{"w":"transcript","pos":"n.","def":"an official record of a student's courses and results","cn":"成績單","s":"Universities abroad asked for my high school ________, so I requested an English copy from the school office.","zh":"國外大學要求我提供高中成績單，所以我向學校辦公室申請了英文版。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A111","t":"成績單"},{"w":"report card","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a school report showing a student's results","cn":"成績通知單","s":"When I brought my ______ ______ home, my parents were happy because my science result had improved a lot.","zh":"我把成績單帶回家時，爸媽很開心，因為我的自然成績進步了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A112","t":"成績單"},{"w":"mark","pos":"v.","def":"to check and give a score to students' work","cn":"批改；評分","s":"The teacher stayed up late to ________ our tests, so we got them back the very next morning.","zh":"老師熬夜批改我們的考卷，所以我們隔天早上就拿回來了。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A113","t":"批改"},{"w":"retake","pos":"v.","def":"to take an exam again after failing or to get a better score","cn":"重考","s":"He decided to ________ the driving test next month, because he had made a small mistake when parking.","zh":"他決定下個月重考駕照，因為他在停車時犯了一個小錯。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A114","t":"重考"},{"w":"standardised","pos":"adj.","def":"the same for everyone, so results can be compared","cn":"標準化的","s":"The GSAT is a ________ test, so students across Taiwan answer the same questions on the same day.","zh":"學測是標準化測驗，所以全台學生在同一天回答同樣的題目。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A115","t":"標準化"},{"w":"entrance exam","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an exam you must pass to join a school or university","cn":"入學考試","s":"She studied for months for the ______ ______, and she was accepted by the medical school she wanted.","zh":"她為入學考試準備了好幾個月，最後被她想要的醫學系錄取。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A116","t":"入學考試"},{"w":"scholarship","pos":"n.","def":"money given to a student to help pay for education","cn":"獎學金","s":"He won a full ________ to study in Canada, so his parents did not have to worry about the fees.","zh":"他獲得了全額獎學金到加拿大念書，所以他父母不必擔心學費。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A117","t":"獎學金"},{"w":"distinction","pos":"n.","def":"the highest level of result in an exam","cn":"優等；優異成績","s":"She passed her piano exam with ________, and her teacher invited her to play at the school concert.","zh":"她以優異成績通過鋼琴檢定，老師邀請她在學校音樂會上演奏。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A118","t":"優異成績"},{"w":"credit","pos":"n.","def":"a unit that shows a student has completed part of a course","cn":"學分","s":"Each elective course is worth two ________, and students need a certain number of them to graduate.","zh":"每門選修課值兩個學分，學生需要修滿一定數量才能畢業。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A119","t":"學分"},{"w":"ranking","pos":"n.","def":"a position in a list showing who is better or worse","cn":"排名","s":"The school no longer posts each student's ________ on the wall, because it made many teenagers feel stressed.","zh":"學校不再把每位學生的排名貼在牆上，因為那讓許多青少年感到壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A120","t":"排名"},{"w":"percentile","pos":"n.","def":"a position showing what percentage of people scored lower","cn":"百分位數","s":"His score put him in the 90th ________, which means he did better than ninety percent of test takers.","zh":"他的分數落在第90百分位數，這表示他考得比百分之九十的考生好。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A121","t":"百分位數"},{"w":"high-stakes","pos":"adj.","def":"having very important results or effects","cn":"高利害的；攸關重大的","s":"University entrance tests are ________ exams, so many students feel huge pressure in their final year.","zh":"大學入學考試是攸關重大的考試，所以許多學生在最後一年感到巨大壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A122","t":"攸關重大"},{"w":"formative","pos":"adj.","def":"used during learning to help students improve","cn":"形成性的","s":"Short ________ tests help teachers see what students do not understand, and they do not count towards the final score.","zh":"簡短的形成性測驗幫助老師看出學生不懂的地方，而且不計入總成績。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A123","t":"形成性"},{"w":"summative","pos":"adj.","def":"used at the end to judge what students have learned","cn":"總結性的","s":"The final exam is a ________ test, so it shows how much students have learned during the whole semester.","zh":"期末考是總結性測驗，所以它顯示學生整學期學到了多少。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A124","t":"總結性"},{"w":"answer sheet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the paper on which students write or mark their answers","cn":"答案卡；答案紙","s":"Use a 2B pencil on the ______ ______, and make sure you fill in each circle completely.","zh":"在答案卡上要用2B鉛筆，並確保每個圓圈都完整塗滿。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A125","t":"答案卡"},{"w":"extension","pos":"n.","def":"extra time given to finish a piece of work","cn":"延期；延長期限","s":"I was ill for a week, so the teacher gave me an ________ and I handed in my project on Friday.","zh":"我病了一週，所以老師讓我延期，我在星期五交了專題。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A126","t":"延期"},{"w":"crib sheet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small hidden paper with answers used to cheat","cn":"小抄","s":"The student hid a ______ ______ in his pencil case, but the invigilator found it within five minutes.","zh":"那位學生把小抄藏在鉛筆盒裡，但監考人員五分鐘內就發現了。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A127","t":"小抄"},{"w":"pass rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the percentage of people who pass an exam","cn":"及格率；通過率","s":"The ______ ______ for the driving test is quite low, so most people take extra lessons before trying it.","zh":"駕照考試的通過率相當低，所以大部分人在應考前會多上幾堂課。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A128","t":"通過率"},{"w":"marking scheme","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the official guide for scoring an exam","cn":"評分標準","s":"Teachers follow the same ______ ______, so students at different schools are scored in a fair way.","zh":"老師們遵循同一套評分標準，所以不同學校的學生都能被公平評分。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A129","t":"評分標準"},{"w":"diploma","pos":"n.","def":"a document showing you have completed a course","cn":"文憑；畢業證書","s":"She proudly held her ________ on stage, and her grandparents took dozens of photos from the audience.","zh":"她在台上驕傲地拿著畢業證書，她的祖父母在觀眾席拍了好幾十張照片。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A130","t":"畢業證書"},{"w":"qualification","pos":"n.","def":"an official record that you have passed exams or training","cn":"資格；學歷證照","s":"You need a teaching ________ to work in a public school, but private cram schools are not always so strict.","zh":"在公立學校任教需要教師資格，但私人補習班不一定那麼嚴格。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A131","t":"資格"},{"w":"band score","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a level from 1 to 9 given in the IELTS test","cn":"（雅思）級分","s":"She needs a ______ ______ of 6.5 for her university application, so she is practising writing every day.","zh":"她的大學申請需要6.5的級分，所以她每天都在練習寫作。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A132","t":"級分"},{"w":"underachieve","pos":"v.","def":"to do less well than your ability suggests","cn":"表現低於應有水準","s":"Bright students sometimes ________ when they feel bored, so teachers try to give them more challenging tasks.","zh":"聰明的學生有時在感到無聊時會表現不如預期，所以老師會試著給他們更有挑戰性的任務。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A133","t":"表現不如預期"},{"w":"high achiever","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who is very successful, especially at school","cn":"成就卓越者；資優生","s":"Lucy is a ______ ______ in every subject, but she still asks for help when she does not understand something.","zh":"露西每一科都是成績頂尖的學生，但遇到不懂的地方她仍然會請求協助。","part":"A","sec":"Exams & Grading 考試與評分","lab":"A134","t":"成績頂尖的學生"},{"w":"undergraduate","pos":"n.","def":"a university student studying for a first degree","cn":"大學部學生","s":"As an ________ she lived in a shared flat, and she worked part-time in a café to pay her rent.","zh":"身為大學部學生，她住在合租公寓，並在咖啡店打工支付房租。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A135","t":"大學部學生"},{"w":"postgraduate","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to study after a first degree","cn":"研究所的","s":"He started a ________ course in engineering, because he wanted to design safer bridges in the future.","zh":"他開始攻讀工程研究所課程，因為他未來想設計更安全的橋梁。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A136","t":"研究所"},{"w":"freshman","pos":"n.","def":"a student in the first year of high school or university","cn":"新鮮人；一年級新生","s":"As a ________ I got lost on campus several times, but older students always helped me find my classroom.","zh":"身為新生，我在校園裡迷路了好幾次，但學長姊總會幫我找到教室。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A137","t":"新生"},{"w":"bachelor's degree","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a first university degree, usually after four years","cn":"學士學位","s":"My sister earned her ______ ______ in nursing, and now she works at a hospital in Kaohsiung.","zh":"我姊姊取得了護理學士學位，現在在高雄的一家醫院工作。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A138","t":"學士學位"},{"w":"master's degree","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a university degree after a bachelor's degree","cn":"碩士學位","s":"Many engineers in Taiwan study for a ______ ______, because it often leads to a higher salary.","zh":"台灣許多工程師攻讀碩士學位，因為這往往能帶來較高的薪水。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A139","t":"碩士學位"},{"w":"doctorate","pos":"n.","def":"the highest university degree, also called a PhD","cn":"博士學位","s":"Dr Chen completed her ________ in marine biology, and she now teaches at a university in Keelung.","zh":"陳博士完成了海洋生物學的博士學位，現在在基隆的一所大學任教。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A140","t":"博士學位"},{"w":"dissertation","pos":"n.","def":"a long piece of writing done for a university degree","cn":"學位論文","s":"He spent his final year writing a ________ on online learning, and his professor praised his careful research.","zh":"他大四整年都在寫一篇關於線上學習的學位論文，教授稱讚他研究嚴謹。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A141","t":"學位論文"},{"w":"major","pos":"n.","def":"the main subject a university student studies","cn":"主修","s":"My ________ is economics, but I am also taking classes in Japanese because I want to work in Tokyo.","zh":"我的主修是經濟學，但我也在修日文課，因為我想在東京工作。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A142","t":"主修"},{"w":"minor","pos":"n.","def":"a second subject studied at university, with fewer courses","cn":"輔修","s":"She chose psychology as her ________, and the extra classes helped her understand her future customers.","zh":"她選擇心理學作為輔修，這些額外課程幫助她了解未來的顧客。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A143","t":"輔修"},{"w":"faculty","pos":"n.","def":"a group of university departments, or all the teaching staff","cn":"學院；全體教職員","s":"The ________ of medicine has a new building, and students can now practise in modern training rooms.","zh":"醫學院有一棟新大樓，學生現在可以在現代化的訓練教室練習。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A144","t":"醫學院"},{"w":"campus","pos":"n.","def":"the land and buildings of a university or school","cn":"校園","s":"The ________ is so large that many students ride bicycles between classes, and some even use electric scooters.","zh":"校園大到許多學生在上課之間騎腳踏車往返，有些人甚至騎電動滑板車。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A145","t":"校園"},{"w":"professor","pos":"n.","def":"a senior teacher at a university","cn":"教授","s":"Our ________ explained the theory with real examples, so even students without a science background understood.","zh":"我們的教授用真實例子解釋理論，所以即使沒有理科背景的學生也聽得懂。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A146","t":"教授"},{"w":"dean","pos":"n.","def":"a person in charge of a faculty or of students at a university","cn":"院長；系主任","s":"The ________ of students met the club leaders, and she agreed to give them more money for events.","zh":"學務長和社團幹部會面，並同意撥給他們更多活動經費。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A147","t":"學務長"},{"w":"admission","pos":"n.","def":"permission to join a school or university","cn":"入學許可；錄取","s":"Her ________ to National Taiwan University surprised no one, because she had worked hard for years.","zh":"她被台大錄取一點也不令人意外，因為她多年來一直很努力。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A148","t":"錄取"},{"w":"student loan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"money borrowed to pay for university, paid back later","cn":"學生貸款","s":"He took out a ______ ______ to pay his fees, so he plans to work for a few years before travelling.","zh":"他申請了學生貸款來支付學費，所以他打算先工作幾年再去旅行。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A149","t":"學生貸款"},{"w":"gap year","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a year off between school and university","cn":"空檔年","s":"After high school she took a ______ ______ to volunteer in Thailand, and it helped her decide what to study.","zh":"高中畢業後她休了一個空檔年去泰國當志工，這幫助她決定要念什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A150","t":"空檔年"},{"w":"exchange student","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a student who studies in another country for a short time","cn":"交換學生","s":"An ______ ______ from Germany joined our class, and we taught her how to use chopsticks.","zh":"一位來自德國的交換學生加入我們班，而我們教她怎麼用筷子。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A151","t":"交換學生"},{"w":"study abroad","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to go to another country to study","cn":"出國留學","s":"Many young Taiwanese hope to ______ ______, but the costs of living overseas can be very high.","zh":"許多台灣年輕人希望出國留學，但在國外生活的費用可能非常高。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A152","t":"出國留學"},{"w":"internship","pos":"n.","def":"a short period of work to gain experience","cn":"實習","s":"She did a summer ________ at a design company, and they offered her a job after she graduated.","zh":"她暑假在一家設計公司實習，而公司在她畢業後提供了她一份工作。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A153","t":"實習"},{"w":"vocational","pos":"adj.","def":"teaching skills for a particular job","cn":"職業的；技職的","s":"He chose a ________ high school to learn car repair, and he opened his own garage at twenty-five.","zh":"他選擇讀技職高中學汽車維修，並在二十五歲時開了自己的修車廠。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A154","t":"技職"},{"w":"apprenticeship","pos":"n.","def":"a period of training for a skilled job with an expert","cn":"學徒期；學徒制","s":"He spent three years in an ________ with a famous baker, and now he runs a popular bakery in Taichung.","zh":"他跟著一位知名麵包師傅當了三年學徒，現在在台中經營一家受歡迎的麵包店。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A155","t":"學徒"},{"w":"accredited","pos":"adj.","def":"officially approved as meeting standards","cn":"經認證的","s":"Make sure the online college is ________, or employers may not accept the degree you earn there.","zh":"務必確認那所線上學院是經過認證的，否則雇主可能不承認你在那裡取得的學位。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A156","t":"經過認證的"},{"w":"elective","pos":"n.","def":"a course that students can choose to take","cn":"選修課","s":"I took photography as an ________ this year, and now I take pictures of the school garden every week.","zh":"我今年選了攝影作為選修課，現在我每週都拍校園花園。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A157","t":"選修課"},{"w":"roommate","pos":"n.","def":"a person who shares a room with you","cn":"室友","s":"My ________ stays up late playing games, so I wear earplugs when I need to sleep before an exam.","zh":"我的室友熬夜打電動，所以考試前需要睡覺時我會戴耳塞。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A158","t":"室友"},{"w":"student union","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an organisation run by students to support them","cn":"學生會","s":"The ______ ______ organised a free concert, and hundreds of students came to relax after their exams.","zh":"學生會舉辦了一場免費音樂會，好幾百位學生考完試後來放鬆。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A159","t":"學生會"},{"w":"research","pos":"n.","def":"careful study to discover new facts","cn":"研究","s":"Her ________ on sleep and memory was published last year, and many teachers have shared it online.","zh":"她關於睡眠與記憶的研究去年發表了，許多老師都在網路上分享。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A160","t":"研究"},{"w":"laboratory","pos":"n.","def":"a room where scientific experiments are done","cn":"實驗室","s":"We wear safety glasses in the chemistry ________, because some liquids can hurt our eyes.","zh":"我們在化學實驗室裡戴護目鏡，因為有些液體可能傷害眼睛。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A161","t":"實驗室"},{"w":"fieldwork","pos":"n.","def":"research done outside, in the real world","cn":"田野調查；實地考察","s":"The geography students did ________ by the river, and they measured how fast the water was flowing.","zh":"地理系學生在河邊做實地考察，並測量了水流的速度。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A162","t":"實地考察"},{"w":"supervisor","pos":"n.","def":"a teacher who guides a student's research","cn":"指導教授；主管","s":"My ________ reads every chapter of my thesis, and she gives detailed comments within a week.","zh":"我的指導教授會讀我論文的每一章，並在一週內給我詳細的意見。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A163","t":"指導教授"},{"w":"dropout","pos":"n.","def":"a person who leaves school before finishing","cn":"輟學生","s":"He was a high school ________, but he went back to study at night and later became a nurse.","zh":"他曾是高中輟學生，但後來回去念夜校，之後成為了護理師。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A164","t":"輟學生"},{"w":"tertiary","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to education at college or university","cn":"高等（教育）的；大專的","s":"Taiwan has many ________ institutions, so almost every high school graduate can find a place at college.","zh":"台灣有許多大專院校，所以幾乎每位高中畢業生都能找到大學可念。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A165","t":"大專"},{"w":"higher education","pos":"n.phr.","def":"education at university or college","cn":"高等教育","s":"The government spends a lot on ______ ______, but some people think vocational training needs more money.","zh":"政府在高等教育上花了很多錢，但有些人認為職業訓練需要更多經費。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A166","t":"高等教育"},{"w":"humanities","pos":"n.","def":"subjects such as history, literature and philosophy","cn":"人文學科","s":"Fewer students now choose the ________, because many parents believe science leads to better jobs.","zh":"現在選讀人文學科的學生變少了，因為許多家長認為理工科能找到較好的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Higher Education & University Life 高等教育與大學生活","lab":"A167","t":"人文學科"},{"w":"gifted","pos":"adj.","def":"having much greater natural ability than most people","cn":"有天賦的；資優的","s":"The school runs a special class for ________ children, but it also tries to keep them with friends their own age.","zh":"學校為資優兒童開設特別班，但也盡量讓他們和同齡朋友待在一起。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A168","t":"資優"},{"w":"talented","pos":"adj.","def":"having a natural ability to do something well","cn":"有才華的","s":"Many ________ young musicians practise for hours every day, so they have little free time for other hobbies.","zh":"許多有才華的年輕音樂家每天練習好幾個小時，所以很少有空從事其他嗜好。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A169","t":"有才華的"},{"w":"prodigy","pos":"n.","def":"a young person with extraordinary ability","cn":"神童","s":"The chess ________ beat several adult players at the age of eight, and newspapers wrote stories about him.","zh":"這位西洋棋神童八歲就打敗了好幾位成人棋手，報紙紛紛報導他。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A170","t":"神童"},{"w":"precocious","pos":"adj.","def":"developing skills much earlier than usual","cn":"早熟的","s":"She was a ________ reader who read adult novels at seven, but she sometimes felt lonely with classmates.","zh":"她是個閱讀能力早熟的孩子，七歲就讀成人小說，但和同學相處時有時會感到孤單。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A171","t":"早熟的"},{"w":"genius","pos":"n.","def":"a person with extremely high intelligence or skill","cn":"天才","s":"People called him a ________ after he won the science prize, but he said hard work mattered more than talent.","zh":"他贏得科學獎後大家稱他為天才，但他說努力比天分更重要。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A172","t":"天才"},{"w":"IQ","pos":"n.","def":"a number that measures a person's thinking ability","cn":"智商","s":"A high ________ does not guarantee success, because skills like patience and teamwork also matter a lot.","zh":"高智商並不保證成功，因為耐心和團隊合作等能力也非常重要。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A173","t":"智商"},{"w":"mixed-ability","pos":"adj.","def":"including students of different levels together","cn":"混合能力的","s":"Teaching a ________ class is challenging, so teachers often prepare easy and difficult versions of each task.","zh":"教導混合能力班級很有挑戰性，所以老師常為每項任務準備簡單和困難兩種版本。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A174","t":"混合能力"},{"w":"streaming","pos":"n.","def":"putting students into classes by their ability level","cn":"能力分班","s":"Some schools have stopped ________, because weaker students in the lowest class often lose confidence.","zh":"有些學校已停止能力分班，因為在最低程度班的弱勢學生常會失去自信。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A175","t":"能力分班"},{"w":"ability grouping","pos":"n.phr.","def":"forming small groups of students at similar levels","cn":"能力分組","s":"Our maths teacher uses ______ ______ for some activities, but she mixes the groups again for projects.","zh":"我們數學老師在某些活動中採用能力分組，但做專題時她會再把各組打散混合。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A176","t":"能力分組"},{"w":"inclusive","pos":"adj.","def":"welcoming and including all kinds of people","cn":"包容的；融合的","s":"An ________ school welcomes students with disabilities, and teachers adapt lessons so everyone can take part.","zh":"融合學校歡迎身心障礙學生，老師也調整課程讓每個人都能參與。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A177","t":"融合"},{"w":"special needs","pos":"n.phr.","def":"extra help that some students need to learn","cn":"特殊需求","s":"Children with ______ ______ may get extra time in exams, so they have a fair chance to show what they know.","zh":"有特殊需求的孩子考試時可能獲得額外時間，讓他們有公平的機會展現所學。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A178","t":"特殊需求"},{"w":"learning disability","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a condition that makes some kinds of learning difficult","cn":"學習障礙","s":"Having a ______ ______ does not mean a child is not clever, and many such students go on to university.","zh":"有學習障礙並不代表孩子不聰明，許多這樣的學生後來都上了大學。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A179","t":"學習障礙"},{"w":"sign language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language that uses hand movements instead of sounds","cn":"手語","s":"Our class learned some basic ______ ______, so we could chat with a new classmate who cannot hear.","zh":"我們班學了一些基本手語，這樣就能和一位聽不見的新同學聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A180","t":"手語"},{"w":"braille","pos":"n.","def":"a system of raised dots that blind people read by touch","cn":"點字","s":"The library now has textbooks in ________, so blind students can read the same lessons as everyone else.","zh":"圖書館現在有點字版課本，所以視障學生能和大家讀一樣的課程。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A181","t":"點字"},{"w":"deaf","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to hear, or not able to hear well","cn":"聾的；聽障的","s":"The ________ student follows lessons through a sign language interpreter, and she is one of the top students.","zh":"這位聽障學生透過手語翻譯員上課，而且她是成績頂尖的學生之一。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A182","t":"聽障"},{"w":"individualised","pos":"adj.","def":"planned for one particular person","cn":"個別化的","s":"Each student with special needs has an ________ learning plan, and teachers review it with parents twice a year.","zh":"每位特殊需求學生都有一份個別化學習計畫，老師每年和家長檢討兩次。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A183","t":"個別化"},{"w":"one-to-one","pos":"adj.","def":"between one teacher and one student","cn":"一對一的","s":"He improved quickly after a few ________ lessons, because the teacher could focus only on his mistakes.","zh":"他上了幾堂一對一課後進步很快，因為老師能只專注在他的錯誤上。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A184","t":"一對一"},{"w":"slow learner","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a student who needs more time to learn","cn":"學習較慢的學生","s":"My father says he was a ______ ______ at school, but he later became an excellent engineer.","zh":"我爸爸說他在學校時是個學得比較慢的學生，但後來成為了優秀的工程師。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A185","t":"學得比較慢的學生"},{"w":"struggling","pos":"adj.","def":"having difficulty doing something","cn":"學習困難的；吃力的","s":"Volunteers tutor ________ readers after school, and many of the children now enjoy reading picture books.","zh":"志工在放學後輔導閱讀有困難的學生，許多孩子現在都喜歡讀繪本了。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A186","t":"閱讀有困難的"},{"w":"underprivileged","pos":"adj.","def":"having less money and fewer chances than most people","cn":"弱勢的；貧困的","s":"The charity gives free laptops to ________ students, so they can join online classes at home.","zh":"這個慈善團體免費提供筆電給弱勢學生，讓他們能在家參加線上課程。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A187","t":"弱勢"},{"w":"disadvantaged","pos":"adj.","def":"facing problems such as poverty that make success harder","cn":"處於不利地位的","s":"Students from ________ families often lack quiet places to study, so the school keeps its library open late.","zh":"來自弱勢家庭的學生常缺乏安靜的讀書空間，所以學校讓圖書館開到很晚。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A188","t":"弱勢"},{"w":"segregate","pos":"v.","def":"to separate one group of people from others","cn":"隔離；分開","s":"In the past many countries would ________ disabled children in separate schools, but today most try to include them.","zh":"過去許多國家會把身心障礙兒童隔離在不同學校，但現在大多數國家努力讓他們融入。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A189","t":"隔離"},{"w":"mainstream","pos":"adj.","def":"ordinary and used by most people","cn":"主流的；一般的","s":"Most students with mild disabilities now attend ________ schools, and they get extra support in certain classes.","zh":"大多數輕度障礙學生現在就讀一般學校，並在某些課程中獲得額外支援。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A190","t":"一般"},{"w":"intensive","pos":"adj.","def":"involving a lot of work in a short time","cn":"密集的","s":"She took an ________ English course in the summer, and she studied six hours a day for four weeks.","zh":"她暑假上了密集英文課，連續四週每天學習六小時。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A191","t":"密集"},{"w":"expectation","pos":"n.","def":"a belief about what someone should achieve","cn":"期望","s":"Her parents had high ________ for her, but they never stopped her from choosing art as her major.","zh":"她父母對她有很高的期望，但他們從未阻止她選擇藝術當主修。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A192","t":"期望"},{"w":"peer","pos":"n.","def":"a person of the same age or level as you","cn":"同儕","s":"Teenagers often care more about the opinions of their ________ than about what adults think.","zh":"青少年往往更在意同儕的看法，而不是大人的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A193","t":"同儕"},{"w":"outstanding","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely good","cn":"傑出的","s":"He gave an ________ performance in the speech contest, and the judges gave him first prize.","zh":"他在演講比賽中表現傑出，評審頒給他第一名。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A194","t":"傑出"},{"w":"elite","pos":"adj.","def":"belonging to the best or most powerful group","cn":"菁英的；頂尖的","s":"Only a few students get into the ________ science class, so competition for places is very strong.","zh":"只有少數學生能進入菁英科學班，所以名額競爭非常激烈。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A195","t":"菁英"},{"w":"meritocracy","pos":"n.","def":"a system where people succeed because of ability and hard work","cn":"功績主義；菁英制度","s":"Supporters say exams create a ________, but critics argue that rich families can still buy extra lessons.","zh":"支持者說考試創造了功績主義的社會，但批評者認為有錢人家仍然可以花錢多補習。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A196","t":"功績主義"},{"w":"privilege","pos":"n.","def":"a special advantage that only some people have","cn":"特權；優勢","s":"Studying abroad is a ________ that many families cannot afford, so scholarships are very important.","zh":"出國念書是許多家庭負擔不起的特權，所以獎學金非常重要。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A197","t":"特權"},{"w":"homeschool","pos":"v.","def":"to teach your children at home instead of sending them to school","cn":"在家自學（教育）","s":"Some parents ________ their children because they want more freedom, but the children still need chances to make friends.","zh":"有些家長讓孩子在家自學，因為他們想要更多自由，但孩子仍需要交朋友的機會。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A198","t":"在家自學"},{"w":"numeracy","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to understand and work with numbers","cn":"數理能力；算術能力","s":"Good ________ is needed in daily life, because we use numbers when we shop, cook and plan our time.","zh":"良好的數理能力在日常生活中是必要的，因為我們購物、煮飯和規劃時間時都會用到數字。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A199","t":"數理能力"},{"w":"socioeconomic","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to social class and money","cn":"社會經濟的","s":"Researchers found that ________ background affects test scores, so the government gives extra money to poorer schools.","zh":"研究者發現社會經濟背景會影響考試成績，所以政府給較貧困的學校額外經費。","part":"A","sec":"Gifted, Mixed-Ability & Inclusive Education 資優、混合能力與融合教育","lab":"A200","t":"社會經濟"},{"w":"intellectual","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the ability to think and understand ideas","cn":"智力的；知識性的","s":"Reading widely gives children ________ challenges, and it also helps them understand other people's feelings.","zh":"廣泛閱讀給孩子帶來智力上的挑戰，也幫助他們理解別人的感受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"智力上的"},{"w":"competent","pos":"adj.","def":"having enough skill to do something well","cn":"有能力的；稱職的","s":"After two years of practice she became a ________ writer, but she still asks her teacher to check her work.","zh":"經過兩年練習，她成為一位稱職的寫作者，但她仍會請老師檢查她的作品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"稱職的"},{"w":"professional","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to a job that needs special training","cn":"專業的","s":"Teachers attend ________ training every summer, so they can learn new ways to support their students.","zh":"老師們每年暑假參加專業培訓，以便學習支持學生的新方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"專業"},{"w":"quote","pos":"v.","def":"to repeat the exact words that someone else said or wrote","cn":"引用；引述","s":"In your report you may ________ a famous scientist, but you must put the words in quotation marks.","zh":"在報告中你可以引用一位知名科學家的話，但必須把那段文字加上引號。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"引用"},{"w":"verbose","pos":"adj.","def":"using more words than are needed","cn":"冗長的；囉唆的","s":"His essay was too ________, so the teacher asked him to cut it from 800 words to 400.","zh":"他的文章太冗長了，所以老師要他從800字刪到400字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"冗長"},{"w":"version","pos":"n.","def":"a slightly different form of something","cn":"版本","s":"The teacher prepared an easier ________ of the article, so weaker readers could follow the class discussion.","zh":"老師準備了這篇文章較簡單的版本，讓閱讀較弱的學生也能跟上課堂討論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"版本"},{"w":"guidance","pos":"n.","def":"help and advice about what to do","cn":"指導；輔導","s":"Students need ________ when they choose a university major, because the decision affects their future career.","zh":"學生選擇大學主修時需要指導，因為這個決定會影響未來的職涯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"指導"},{"w":"appreciate","pos":"v.","def":"to understand the value of something","cn":"欣賞；重視；感激","s":"I did not ________ my history teacher at first, but now I understand how much she taught me.","zh":"一開始我並不欣賞我的歷史老師，但現在我明白她教了我多少東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"欣賞"},{"w":"brief","pos":"adj.","def":"short, using few words or lasting a short time","cn":"簡短的","s":"Please give a ________ answer to each question, because you only have twenty minutes for the whole section.","zh":"請每題給出簡短的回答，因為整個部分你只有二十分鐘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"簡短的"},{"w":"commentary","pos":"n.","def":"a set of comments explaining or judging something","cn":"評論；解說","s":"The teacher wrote a short ________ on each poem, and it helped us understand the writer's hidden meaning.","zh":"老師為每首詩寫了一段簡短的評論，這幫助我們理解作者隱含的意思。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"評論"},{"w":"conference","pos":"n.","def":"a large formal meeting where people discuss ideas","cn":"研討會；會議","s":"Our principal attended an education ________ in Singapore, and she came back with many new ideas for our school.","zh":"我們校長參加了在新加坡舉辦的教育研討會，帶回許多給學校的新點子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"研討會"},{"w":"credential","pos":"n.","def":"a qualification that shows you are able to do a job","cn":"資歷證明；資格證書","s":"Online courses can give useful ________, but employers still want to see real skills in interviews.","zh":"線上課程能提供有用的資格證明，但雇主在面試時仍想看到真正的能力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"資格證明"},{"w":"acumen","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to make good, quick judgements","cn":"敏銳；精明","s":"She showed great business ________ when she ran the school café, so the club made a big profit.","zh":"她經營學校咖啡店時展現了極佳的商業敏銳度，所以社團賺了一大筆錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"敏銳度"},{"w":"erudite","pos":"adj.","def":"having a great deal of knowledge from reading","cn":"博學的","s":"Our ________ professor can talk about almost any topic, yet he explains things in very simple language.","zh":"我們那位博學的教授幾乎能談論任何話題，但他用非常簡單的語言解釋事情。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"博學的"},{"w":"pedantic","pos":"adj.","def":"caring too much about small details and rules","cn":"迂腐的；過分拘泥細節的","s":"Some students think the teacher is ________ about commas, but good punctuation makes writing much clearer.","zh":"有些學生覺得老師對逗號過分講究，但良好的標點讓文章清楚得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"過分講究"},{"w":"didactic","pos":"adj.","def":"intended to teach, often in a way that feels like a lecture","cn":"說教的；教誨的","s":"The film was too ________, so the audience felt they were being lectured instead of entertained.","zh":"這部電影太說教了，所以觀眾覺得自己在被訓話而不是在娛樂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"說教"},{"w":"formulaic","pos":"adj.","def":"following a fixed pattern, with no originality","cn":"公式化的","s":"Many exam essays are ________, because students memorise the same opening sentences and use them every time.","zh":"許多考試作文都很公式化，因為學生背誦同樣的開頭句並每次都使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"公式化"},{"w":"abide","pos":"v.","def":"to accept and follow a rule or decision","cn":"遵守（abide by）","s":"All candidates must ________ by the exam rules, or their results may be cancelled without any warning.","zh":"所有考生都必須遵守考試規則，否則成績可能會在沒有任何警告的情況下被取消。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"遵守"},{"w":"abridged","pos":"adj.","def":"made shorter by removing some parts","cn":"刪節的；簡寫的","s":"We read an ________ version of the novel, because the original was too long for a one-month course.","zh":"我們讀的是這本小說的簡寫版，因為原著對一個月的課程來說太長了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"簡寫"},{"w":"absurd","pos":"adj.","def":"completely silly or unreasonable","cn":"荒謬的","s":"It seems ________ to give young children three hours of homework a night, and many parents have complained.","zh":"讓幼童每晚寫三小時作業似乎很荒謬，許多家長已經提出抱怨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"荒謬"},{"w":"accolade","pos":"n.","def":"praise or an award for an achievement","cn":"讚譽；獎項","s":"The teacher received the highest ________ in the city, but she said the real winners were her students.","zh":"這位老師獲得全市最高的榮譽，但她說真正的贏家是她的學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"榮譽"},{"w":"accommodate","pos":"v.","def":"to provide what someone needs","cn":"容納；照顧到（需求）","s":"The new library can ________ three hundred students, so it is never too crowded even during exams.","zh":"新圖書館能容納三百名學生，所以即使考試期間也不會太擁擠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"容納"},{"w":"acquaint","pos":"v.","def":"to make yourself or someone familiar with something","cn":"使熟悉；使認識","s":"Before the trip, the teacher wanted to ________ us with local customs, so she showed a short video about Japan.","zh":"出發前老師想讓我們熟悉當地習俗，所以她播放了一段關於日本的短片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"熟悉"},{"w":"adaptable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to change to suit new situations","cn":"適應力強的","s":"Children are very ________, so most of them settle into a new school within a few weeks.","zh":"孩子的適應力很強，所以大多數在幾週內就能適應新學校。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"適應力很強"},{"w":"administer","pos":"v.","def":"to organise and give something such as a test","cn":"施行；實施（考試等）","s":"The teachers will ________ the reading test in the morning, and the results will be ready by Friday.","zh":"老師們將在早上實施閱讀測驗，結果會在星期五前出爐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"實施"},{"w":"admirable","pos":"adj.","def":"deserving respect and approval","cn":"令人欽佩的","s":"Her effort to learn three languages is ________, especially because she also works part-time after school.","zh":"她努力學習三種語言的精神令人欽佩，尤其是她放學後還要打工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"令人欽佩"},{"w":"agile","pos":"adj.","def":"able to move or think quickly and easily","cn":"敏捷的；靈活的","s":"Chess keeps the mind ________, and many retired people play it in the park every afternoon.","zh":"下西洋棋能讓頭腦保持靈活，許多退休人士每天下午都在公園下棋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"靈活"},{"w":"allot","pos":"v.","def":"to give a share of time or money for a purpose","cn":"分配；撥出","s":"The teacher will ________ five minutes to each group, so please plan your presentation carefully.","zh":"老師會分配給每組五分鐘，所以請仔細規劃你們的報告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"分配"},{"w":"amass","pos":"v.","def":"to collect a large amount of something over time","cn":"累積；積聚","s":"Over four years she ________ a huge collection of English novels, and she now lends them to classmates.","zh":"四年來她累積了大量的英文小說，現在她把書借給同學。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"累積"},{"w":"amateur","pos":"adj.","def":"doing something for enjoyment, not as a job","cn":"業餘的","s":"He is only an ________ photographer, but his pictures of the school festival were printed in the newspaper.","zh":"他只是個業餘攝影師，但他拍的校慶照片登上了報紙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"業餘"},{"w":"ameliorate","pos":"v.","def":"to make a bad situation better","cn":"改善","s":"The city built new libraries to ________ the lack of study space, and they are now full every weekend.","zh":"市政府蓋了新圖書館來改善讀書空間不足的問題，現在每個週末都座無虛席。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"改善"},{"w":"amenable","pos":"adj.","def":"willing to accept or be influenced by ideas","cn":"願意接受的","s":"The principal was ________ to the students' suggestion, so the school changed the lunch break to one hour.","zh":"校長願意接受學生的建議，所以學校把午休改成一小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"願意接受"},{"w":"antiquated","pos":"adj.","def":"old-fashioned and no longer suitable","cn":"過時的；老舊的","s":"The school's computers are ________, so students often bring their own laptops to finish projects.","zh":"學校的電腦老舊過時，所以學生常自己帶筆電來完成專題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"老舊過時"},{"w":"apt","pos":"adj.","def":"suitable or right for a situation","cn":"恰當的","s":"\"Practice makes perfect\" was an ________ title for her speech, because she talked about learning the violin.","zh":"「熟能生巧」是她演講恰當的標題，因為她談的是學小提琴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"恰當的"},{"w":"archaic","pos":"adj.","def":"very old and no longer used","cn":"古老的；已不使用的","s":"Shakespeare uses many ________ words, so students often need notes to understand his famous plays today.","zh":"莎士比亞使用許多古老的字詞，所以現今學生常需要註解才能理解他的名劇。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"古老的"},{"w":"ardent","pos":"adj.","def":"very enthusiastic and passionate","cn":"熱心的；熱烈的","s":"My uncle is an ________ supporter of free education, and he volunteers at a reading centre every Sunday.","zh":"我叔叔是免費教育的熱烈支持者，他每個星期天都在閱讀中心當志工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"熱烈"},{"w":"assiduous","pos":"adj.","def":"working very carefully and with great effort","cn":"勤勉的；刻苦的","s":"She was an ________ student who checked every answer twice, so she rarely made careless mistakes.","zh":"她是個勤勉的學生，每個答案都檢查兩次，所以很少粗心犯錯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"勤勉的"},{"w":"austere","pos":"adj.","def":"very plain and simple, without comfort","cn":"簡樸的；樸素的","s":"The old boarding school had ________ rooms with only a bed and a desk, but the students did not complain.","zh":"那所舊寄宿學校的房間很簡樸，只有一張床和一張書桌，但學生們沒有抱怨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"簡樸"},{"w":"avid","pos":"adj.","def":"very keen and enthusiastic about something","cn":"熱衷的","s":"He is an ________ reader of science fiction, and he borrows at least three books from the library each week.","zh":"他是科幻小說的熱衷讀者，每週至少從圖書館借三本書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"熱衷"},{"w":"axiom","pos":"n.","def":"a statement accepted as true without needing proof","cn":"公理；格言","s":"It is an ________ in education that children learn best when they feel safe, so schools must stop bullying.","zh":"孩子在感到安全時學得最好，這是教育界的公理，所以學校必須杜絕霸凌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"公理"},{"w":"belittle","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone or something seem unimportant","cn":"貶低；輕視","s":"Good teachers never ________ students' questions, because even simple questions can lead to deep learning.","zh":"好老師從不輕視學生的問題，因為即使是簡單的問題也可能帶來深入的學習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"輕視"},{"w":"brevity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of using few words","cn":"簡潔；簡短","s":"The judges praised the speech for its ________, because she made three strong points in only two minutes.","zh":"評審稱讚這篇演講簡潔，因為她只用兩分鐘就提出三個有力的論點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"簡潔"},{"w":"bureaucracy","pos":"n.","def":"a system with many complicated official rules","cn":"官僚制度；繁文縟節","s":"Teachers complain about too much ________, because they spend hours filling in forms instead of preparing lessons.","zh":"老師們抱怨太多繁文縟節，因為他們花好幾個小時填表格而不是備課。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"繁文縟節"},{"w":"calibre","pos":"n.","def":"the level of quality or ability","cn":"才幹；水準","s":"The school attracts teachers of high ________, so its students often win national science prizes.","zh":"這所學校吸引了高水準的教師，所以學生常贏得全國科學獎項。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"水準"},{"w":"categorical","pos":"adj.","def":"very clear and certain, with no doubt","cn":"絕對的；明確的","s":"The principal gave a ________ answer that phones would not be allowed in class, so nobody argued.","zh":"校長明確表示上課時不准使用手機，所以沒有人爭論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"明確"},{"w":"censure","pos":"v.","def":"to criticise someone strongly and officially","cn":"譴責；責難","s":"The education board ________ the school for hiding its exam problems, and the principal later resigned.","zh":"教育局譴責這所學校隱瞞考試問題，校長後來辭職了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"譴責"},{"w":"cerebral","pos":"adj.","def":"needing careful thought rather than feelings","cn":"需要動腦的；理性的","s":"Chess is a very ________ game, but young children can still enjoy it with simple rules.","zh":"西洋棋是非常需要動腦的遊戲，但幼童仍能用簡單的規則樂在其中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"需要動腦"},{"w":"chronological","pos":"adj.","def":"arranged in the order in which events happened","cn":"按時間順序的","s":"Put the events in ________ order, and then write a short paragraph about the most important one.","zh":"把事件按時間順序排列，然後針對最重要的事件寫一小段。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"時間順序"},{"w":"coerce","pos":"v.","def":"to force someone to do something they do not want to do","cn":"強迫；脅迫","s":"Parents should not ________ children into studying medicine, because forced choices often lead to unhappy careers.","zh":"父母不應強迫孩子讀醫科，因為被迫的選擇常導致不快樂的職涯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"強迫"},{"w":"cogent","pos":"adj.","def":"clear, logical and able to persuade people","cn":"有說服力的","s":"Her argument was ________ and well organised, so the debate judges gave her team the highest score.","zh":"她的論點有說服力且條理分明，所以辯論評審給她的隊伍最高分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"有說服力"},{"w":"collate","pos":"v.","def":"to collect and arrange information in order","cn":"整理；彙整","s":"The class leader will ________ everyone's answers to the survey, and then she will share the results on Monday.","zh":"班長會彙整大家的問卷答案，然後在星期一分享結果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"彙整"},{"w":"colloquial","pos":"adj.","def":"used in informal conversation, not formal writing","cn":"口語的","s":"\"Gonna\" is a ________ word, so you should not use it in an academic essay or a formal email.","zh":"gonna 是口語用字，所以不應用在學術文章或正式電子郵件中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"口語"},{"w":"commensurate","pos":"adj.","def":"matching in size, amount or level","cn":"相稱的；相當的","s":"Teachers want salaries ________ with their long working hours, but the budget has not increased for years.","zh":"老師們希望薪水與長工時相稱，但預算已經好幾年沒有增加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"相稱"},{"w":"compartmentalise","pos":"v.","def":"to divide things into separate parts","cn":"把…分隔開；區隔處理","s":"Schools often ________ knowledge into separate subjects, but real problems need science, maths and language together.","zh":"學校常把知識分隔成各別科目，但真實的問題需要同時運用科學、數學和語言。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"分隔"},{"w":"concerted","pos":"adj.","def":"done by people working together with determination","cn":"共同的；齊心協力的","s":"Parents and teachers made a ________ effort to reduce phone use, and students now talk more during breaks.","zh":"家長和老師齊心協力減少手機使用，現在學生下課時聊天變多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"齊心協力"},{"w":"condense","pos":"v.","def":"to make a text shorter but keep the main ideas","cn":"濃縮；精簡","s":"Try to ________ your notes onto one page, because it is easier to review a short summary before the test.","zh":"試著把筆記濃縮成一頁，因為考前複習簡短的摘要比較容易。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"濃縮"},{"w":"conversant","pos":"adj.","def":"having knowledge of something","cn":"熟悉的；精通的","s":"Most students are ________ with social media, but many still do not know how to check facts online.","zh":"大多數學生熟悉社群媒體，但許多人仍不知道如何在網路上查證事實。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"熟悉"},{"w":"copious","pos":"adj.","def":"in large amounts","cn":"大量的；豐富的","s":"She took ________ notes during the lecture, so she could explain every detail to her sick friend later.","zh":"她上課時做了大量筆記，所以之後能向生病的朋友解釋每個細節。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"大量"},{"w":"credence","pos":"n.","def":"belief that something is true","cn":"相信；可信度","s":"The new study gives ________ to the idea that sleep helps memory, so schools may start classes later.","zh":"這項新研究為「睡眠有助記憶」的說法增添了可信度，所以學校可能會延後上課時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"可信度"},{"w":"critique","pos":"v.","def":"to judge something carefully, showing good and bad points","cn":"評論；評析","s":"In art class we ________ each other's paintings, but we must always begin with something positive.","zh":"美術課上我們互相評析彼此的畫作，但一定要先從優點說起。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"評析"},{"w":"cursory","pos":"adj.","def":"done quickly without paying attention to details","cn":"粗略的；草率的","s":"He gave the article only a ________ glance, so he missed the most important point in the last paragraph.","zh":"他只是粗略看了一眼那篇文章，所以錯過了最後一段最重要的重點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"粗略"},{"w":"debilitate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone or something very weak","cn":"使衰弱","s":"Lack of sleep can ________ students during exam season, so doctors advise at least seven hours a night.","zh":"睡眠不足會在考試期間使學生虛弱，所以醫生建議每晚至少睡七小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"使 虛弱"},{"w":"decipher","pos":"v.","def":"to work out the meaning of something difficult to read","cn":"辨認；解讀","s":"The teacher could not ________ his messy handwriting, so she asked him to type his essay next time.","zh":"老師無法辨認他潦草的字跡，所以要他下次把作文打字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"辨認"},{"w":"deference","pos":"n.","def":"polite respect for someone's opinion or position","cn":"尊重；敬意","s":"In many Asian classrooms students show ________ to teachers, but this can make them afraid to ask questions.","zh":"在許多亞洲教室裡學生對老師表現敬意，但這可能使他們不敢發問。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"敬意"},{"w":"delve","pos":"v.","def":"to search deeply for information","cn":"深入探究","s":"For her project she ________ into old newspapers, and she discovered how her school was founded in 1920.","zh":"為了專題她深入研究舊報紙，發現了她的學校在1920年是如何創立的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"深入研究"},{"w":"demeanour","pos":"n.","def":"the way a person behaves or looks","cn":"舉止；態度","s":"The examiner had a calm ________, so the nervous students relaxed as soon as the interview started.","zh":"主考官舉止沉穩，所以緊張的學生在面試一開始就放鬆了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"舉止"},{"w":"demystify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something easier to understand","cn":"使易懂；揭開神秘面紗","s":"The workshop aims to ________ university applications, so parents can help their children without paying agents.","zh":"這個工作坊旨在讓大學申請流程變得易懂，讓家長不用花錢請代辦也能協助孩子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"讓 變得易懂"},{"w":"denounce","pos":"v.","def":"to criticise something strongly in public","cn":"公開譴責","s":"Many teachers ________ the plan to cut art classes, and they started a campaign to protect them.","zh":"許多老師公開譴責刪減美術課的計畫，並發起運動來保護這些課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"公開譴責"},{"w":"deride","pos":"v.","def":"to laugh at someone in an unkind way","cn":"嘲笑","s":"Other students used to ________ his accent, but now he speaks three languages and works as an interpreter.","zh":"以前其他學生常嘲笑他的口音，但現在他會說三種語言並擔任口譯員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"嘲笑"},{"w":"desirable","pos":"adj.","def":"worth having or wanting","cn":"令人嚮往的；理想的","s":"Good communication skills are highly ________ in any job, so schools should give students chances to speak.","zh":"良好的溝通能力在任何工作中都非常理想，所以學校應該給學生說話的機會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"理想"},{"w":"dexterity","pos":"n.","def":"skill in using your hands or mind","cn":"靈巧；熟練","s":"Playing the piano improves finger ________, and it also trains children to read music quickly.","zh":"彈鋼琴能提升手指的靈巧度，也訓練孩子快速讀譜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"靈巧度"},{"w":"digress","pos":"v.","def":"to talk about something not connected to the main topic","cn":"離題","s":"Our history teacher often ________ to tell funny stories, but we always learn something from them.","zh":"我們的歷史老師常常離題講有趣的故事，但我們總能從中學到東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"離題"},{"w":"disseminate","pos":"v.","def":"to spread information widely","cn":"傳播；散布","s":"The school uses an app to ________ news to parents, so nobody misses important dates any more.","zh":"學校用一款應用程式向家長傳播消息，所以再也沒有人錯過重要日期。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"傳播"},{"w":"distil","pos":"v.","def":"to take the most important ideas from something","cn":"提煉；萃取精華","s":"The teacher helped us ________ the long article into five key points, and we wrote them on a poster.","zh":"老師幫我們把那篇長文章提煉成五個重點，並寫在海報上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"提煉"},{"w":"doctrine","pos":"n.","def":"a set of beliefs taught by a group","cn":"學說；教義","s":"The old ________ that children should be seen and not heard is disappearing, and students now share opinions freely.","zh":"「小孩有耳無嘴」的舊觀念正在消失，現在學生可以自由分享意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"觀念"},{"w":"dogmatic","pos":"adj.","def":"sure that your beliefs are right and refusing other ideas","cn":"武斷的；教條的","s":"A ________ teacher may stop students from thinking critically, because they learn that only one answer is accepted.","zh":"教條式的老師可能會阻礙學生批判思考，因為他們學到只有一個答案被接受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"教條式的"},{"w":"eclectic","pos":"adj.","def":"including ideas or styles from many different sources","cn":"兼容並蓄的；多元的","s":"She has an ________ taste in books, so her shelves hold poetry, comics, history and science fiction.","zh":"她閱讀品味多元，所以書架上有詩集、漫畫、歷史和科幻小說。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"多元"},{"w":"egalitarian","pos":"adj.","def":"believing everyone should have equal rights and chances","cn":"平等主義的","s":"Finland has a very ________ school system, and almost every child attends a free local school.","zh":"芬蘭的學校制度非常平等，幾乎每個孩子都就讀免費的社區學校。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"平等"},{"w":"elucidate","pos":"v.","def":"to explain something clearly","cn":"闡明；解釋清楚","s":"The professor used a simple diagram to ________ the theory, and suddenly the whole class understood it.","zh":"教授用一張簡單的圖表來闡明這個理論，全班突然都懂了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"闡明"},{"w":"eminent","pos":"adj.","def":"famous and respected in a particular field","cn":"傑出的；著名的","s":"An ________ scientist visited our school, and she encouraged girls to study physics and engineering.","zh":"一位著名的科學家來訪我們學校，並鼓勵女生攻讀物理和工程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"著名的"},{"w":"emphatic","pos":"adj.","def":"said with force to show something is important","cn":"強調的；斷然的","s":"Her answer was ________: she would not let her son quit school, even though he wanted to become a gamer.","zh":"她的回答很斷然：即使兒子想當電玩選手，她也不會讓他休學。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"斷然"},{"w":"encapsulate","pos":"v.","def":"to express the main idea in a short way","cn":"概括；簡述","s":"Your title should ________ the main idea of your essay, so the reader knows what to expect.","zh":"你的標題應該概括文章的主旨，讓讀者知道會讀到什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"概括"},{"w":"endow","pos":"v.","def":"to give a large amount of money to a school or other organisation","cn":"捐贈；資助","s":"A former student ________ the library with a million dollars, and it now has a new reading room.","zh":"一位校友捐贈了一百萬元給圖書館，現在圖書館有了一間新的閱覽室。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"捐贈"},{"w":"engender","pos":"v.","def":"to cause a feeling or situation to exist","cn":"引起；產生","s":"Constant comparison with classmates can ________ jealousy, so parents should focus on their child's own progress.","zh":"不斷和同學比較可能會引起嫉妒，所以家長應關注孩子自身的進步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"引起"},{"w":"enumerate","pos":"v.","def":"to name things one by one in a list","cn":"列舉","s":"The teacher asked us to ________ the causes of the war, and then we discussed which one was most important.","zh":"老師要我們列舉戰爭的起因，然後我們討論哪一個最重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"列舉"},{"w":"esoteric","pos":"adj.","def":"understood only by a small group of experts","cn":"深奧的；冷門難懂的","s":"The lecture was too ________ for first-year students, so many of them stopped taking notes after ten minutes.","zh":"這堂課對大一學生來說太深奧了，所以很多人十分鐘後就不再做筆記。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"深奧"},{"w":"espouse","pos":"v.","def":"to support an idea or belief","cn":"擁護；支持","s":"Many modern teachers ________ learning through play, and they believe children remember more when they have fun.","zh":"許多現代老師擁護從遊戲中學習，他們相信孩子在快樂時記得更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"擁護"},{"w":"exacting","pos":"adj.","def":"needing a lot of care, effort and skill","cn":"要求嚴格的；費力的","s":"The music academy has ________ standards, so students practise for many hours before each audition.","zh":"這所音樂學院標準嚴格，所以學生在每次試鏡前都要練習好幾個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"嚴格"},{"w":"exasperate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone very annoyed","cn":"激怒；使惱火","s":"Students who chat during tests ________ the teacher, so she now moves them to the front row.","zh":"考試時聊天的學生惹惱了老師，所以她現在把他們移到第一排。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"惹惱"},{"w":"exempt","pos":"adj.","def":"not required to do something that others must do","cn":"被免除的","s":"Students with a high listening score are ________ from the extra class, so they can use the time for self-study.","zh":"聽力分數高的學生免上加強課，所以他們能用這段時間自修。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"免"},{"w":"expound","pos":"v.","def":"to explain an idea in detail","cn":"詳細闡述","s":"The guest speaker ________ on the history of Taiwanese education, and he answered questions for an hour afterwards.","zh":"客座講者詳細闡述台灣教育的歷史，之後還回答了一個小時的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"詳細闡述"},{"w":"facile","pos":"adj.","def":"too simple and not showing careful thought","cn":"膚淺的；輕率的","s":"Saying that students are lazy is a ________ explanation, because many of them are simply tired from long school days.","zh":"說學生懶惰是膚淺的解釋，因為他們很多人只是被漫長的上學日累壞了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"膚淺的"},{"w":"fallible","pos":"adj.","def":"able to make mistakes","cn":"會犯錯的","s":"Teachers are ________ like everyone else, so they should admit their mistakes in front of students.","zh":"老師和其他人一樣會犯錯，所以應該在學生面前承認錯誤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"會犯錯"},{"w":"frivolous","pos":"adj.","def":"not serious or important","cn":"輕浮的；無關緊要的","s":"Some parents see drama club as ________, but it builds confidence and teamwork that are useful in any job.","zh":"有些家長認為戲劇社無關緊要，但它培養的自信和團隊合作在任何工作中都很有用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"無關緊要"},{"w":"galvanise","pos":"v.","def":"to shock or excite someone into taking action","cn":"激勵；促使行動","s":"The flood in the village ________ students to raise money, and they collected enough to rebuild the school library.","zh":"村莊的水災激勵學生募款，他們募到足夠的錢重建學校圖書館。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"激勵"},{"w":"garner","pos":"v.","def":"to collect or gain something such as support","cn":"獲得；贏得","s":"Her speech about mental health ________ a lot of support, and the school agreed to hire another counsellor.","zh":"她關於心理健康的演講贏得大量支持，學校同意再聘一位輔導老師。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"贏得"},{"w":"glean","pos":"v.","def":"to collect information slowly, in small amounts","cn":"蒐集（資訊）；點滴獲得","s":"I ________ useful tips from older students, and they helped me prepare for my university interview.","zh":"我從學長姊那裡蒐集到許多有用的建議，它們幫助我準備大學面試。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"蒐集"},{"w":"grapple","pos":"v.","def":"to try hard to deal with a difficult problem","cn":"努力解決；奮力應付","s":"Many schools ________ with how to use AI tools fairly, but there are still no clear national rules.","zh":"許多學校正努力解決如何公平使用人工智慧工具的問題，但至今仍沒有明確的全國規範。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"努力解決"},{"w":"haphazard","pos":"adj.","def":"not planned or organised","cn":"雜亂無章的；隨意的","s":"His ________ way of studying wasted a lot of time, so his tutor helped him make a weekly plan.","zh":"他雜亂無章的讀書方式浪費了很多時間，所以家教幫他制定了每週計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"雜亂無章"},{"w":"hone","pos":"v.","def":"to improve a skill through practice","cn":"磨練","s":"She joined the debate club to ________ her speaking skills, and now she is confident in every presentation.","zh":"她加入辯論社來磨練口語能力，現在她在每次報告中都充滿自信。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"磨練"},{"w":"idiosyncratic","pos":"adj.","def":"unusual and typical of one particular person","cn":"獨特的；特立獨行的","s":"The professor has an ________ teaching style, but students love his classes because they are never boring.","zh":"這位教授的教學風格很獨特，但學生喜歡他的課，因為從不無聊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"獨特"},{"w":"illustrious","pos":"adj.","def":"famous and admired because of great achievements","cn":"傑出的；顯赫的","s":"The university has an ________ history, and several of its former students have won Nobel Prizes.","zh":"這所大學有輝煌的歷史，好幾位校友都得過諾貝爾獎。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"輝煌的"},{"w":"impart","pos":"v.","def":"to pass knowledge or skills to someone","cn":"傳授；傳遞","s":"Good teachers do more than ________ facts, because they also show students how to think for themselves.","zh":"好老師不只是傳授事實，他們也教學生如何獨立思考。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"傳授"},{"w":"impoverished","pos":"adj.","def":"very poor","cn":"貧困的","s":"Children in ________ villages often walk for hours to school, but many of them still dream of going to university.","zh":"貧困村莊的孩子常要走好幾個小時去上學，但他們許多人仍夢想上大學。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"貧困"},{"w":"incongruous","pos":"adj.","def":"strange because it does not fit the situation","cn":"不協調的；格格不入的","s":"His bright red suit looked ________ at the serious graduation ceremony, and many people turned to stare at him.","zh":"他那套鮮紅色西裝在莊重的畢業典禮上顯得格格不入，許多人轉頭盯著他看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"格格不入"},{"w":"inconsequential","pos":"adj.","def":"not important","cn":"無關緊要的","s":"Don't waste time on ________ details in the exam, because the main argument is worth most of the marks.","zh":"考試時別把時間浪費在無關緊要的細節上，因為主要論點佔了大部分的分數。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"無關緊要的"},{"w":"indoctrinate","pos":"v.","def":"to teach people to accept beliefs without questioning them","cn":"灌輸（思想）","s":"Schools should not ________ students with one political view, but should help them compare different opinions.","zh":"學校不應向學生灌輸單一政治觀點，而應幫助他們比較不同意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"灌輸"},{"w":"inexorable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to stop","cn":"無法阻擋的","s":"The ________ rise of online learning has changed schools, and even grandparents now take courses on their phones.","zh":"線上學習勢不可擋的興起改變了學校，連祖父母現在都用手機上課。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"勢不可擋"},{"w":"instigate","pos":"v.","def":"to start an action or event","cn":"發起；促成","s":"The students ________ a campaign to save the old school tree, and the city finally agreed to protect it.","zh":"學生們發起了一場拯救校園老樹的運動，市政府最後同意保護它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"發起"},{"w":"ingenuity","pos":"n.","def":"skill in thinking of clever new ideas","cn":"巧思；創造力","s":"The robot team showed great ________, because they built their machine from old bicycles and plastic bottles.","zh":"機器人隊展現了極大的巧思，因為他們用舊腳踏車和塑膠瓶打造機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"巧思"},{"w":"instrumental","pos":"adj.","def":"very important in making something happen","cn":"起重要作用的","s":"My English teacher was ________ in helping me win the scholarship, so I sent her a thank-you card.","zh":"我的英文老師在幫助我贏得獎學金這件事上功不可沒，所以我寄了一張感謝卡給她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"功不可沒"},{"w":"intelligible","pos":"adj.","def":"clear enough to be understood","cn":"可理解的；清楚易懂的","s":"Your accent does not matter much, as long as your speech is ________ and your ideas are clear.","zh":"你的口音不太重要，只要你的話語清楚易懂、想法清晰就好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"清楚易懂"},{"w":"interdisciplinary","pos":"adj.","def":"involving two or more subjects","cn":"跨學科的","s":"Our ________ project combined history and art, so we painted a mural about our town's past.","zh":"我們的跨學科專題結合了歷史與藝術，所以我們畫了一幅關於小鎮過去的壁畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"跨學科"},{"w":"jargon","pos":"n.","def":"special words used by a group that others find hard to understand","cn":"術語；行話","s":"The report was full of education ________, so many parents could not understand the new policy.","zh":"這份報告充滿教育術語，所以許多家長看不懂新政策。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"術語"},{"w":"juxtapose","pos":"v.","def":"to put two things side by side to compare them","cn":"並列；並置","s":"The writer ________ a rich school and a poor school, and the contrast made readers think about fairness.","zh":"作者把一所富裕學校和一所貧窮學校並列比較，這種對比讓讀者思考公平問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"並列"},{"w":"laborious","pos":"adj.","def":"needing a lot of time and effort","cn":"費力的；辛苦的","s":"Copying notes by hand is ________, but some studies show it helps students remember more.","zh":"用手抄筆記很費力，但有些研究顯示它能幫助學生記住更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"費力"},{"w":"laudable","pos":"adj.","def":"deserving praise","cn":"值得稱讚的","s":"The plan to give every child a free breakfast is ________, but the city still needs to find the money.","zh":"讓每個孩子都有免費早餐的計畫值得稱讚，但市政府仍需籌措經費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"值得稱讚"},{"w":"lax","pos":"adj.","def":"not strict enough","cn":"鬆散的；不嚴格的","s":"Security at the exam centre was ________, so some students brought their phones into the room.","zh":"考場的安全管理很鬆散，所以有些學生把手機帶進了考場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"鬆散"},{"w":"legible","pos":"adj.","def":"clear enough to read","cn":"字跡清楚的；易讀的","s":"Please make your handwriting ________, because the examiners cannot give marks for words they cannot read.","zh":"請把字寫得清楚易讀，因為閱卷人無法為看不懂的字給分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"清楚易讀"},{"w":"literal","pos":"adj.","def":"using the basic meaning of a word","cn":"字面上的","s":"A ________ translation of an idiom often sounds strange, so translators look for a phrase with the same feeling.","zh":"成語的字面翻譯常常聽起來很奇怪，所以譯者會找有相同感覺的說法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"字面"},{"w":"lofty","pos":"adj.","def":"very high, noble or ambitious","cn":"崇高的；遠大的","s":"The school has ________ goals for every student, but some teachers worry that the targets are unrealistic.","zh":"學校為每位學生設定了遠大的目標，但有些老師擔心這些目標不切實際。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"遠大的"},{"w":"longitudinal","pos":"adj.","def":"studying the same people over a long time","cn":"縱貫的；長期追蹤的","s":"A ________ study followed 1,000 children for twenty years, and it found that reading at home predicted later success.","zh":"一項長期追蹤研究追蹤了一千名兒童二十年，發現在家閱讀能預測日後的成功。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"長期追蹤"},{"w":"malleable","pos":"adj.","def":"easily changed or influenced","cn":"可塑的；易受影響的","s":"Young minds are ________, so the habits children form at school can last for their whole lives.","zh":"年輕的心智是可塑的，所以孩子在學校養成的習慣可能維持一輩子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"可塑的"},{"w":"mandatory","pos":"adj.","def":"required by law or rules","cn":"強制的；義務的","s":"Swimming lessons are ________ in many schools in Taiwan, because the island is surrounded by sea.","zh":"游泳課在台灣許多學校是必修的，因為這座島四面環海。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"必修的"},{"w":"maxim","pos":"n.","def":"a short saying that gives a rule for behaviour","cn":"格言；座右銘","s":"My grandfather's favourite ________ was \"Never stop learning\", and he took a computer class at eighty.","zh":"我祖父最喜歡的格言是「學無止境」，他八十歲時還去上電腦課。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"格言"},{"w":"methodical","pos":"adj.","def":"doing things carefully in a planned order","cn":"有條不紊的","s":"Lisa is very ________ when she studies, so she always finishes her review a week before the test.","zh":"麗莎讀書時非常有條不紊，所以她總在考試前一週就完成複習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"有條不紊"},{"w":"modest","pos":"adj.","def":"not very large; or not talking much about your success","cn":"適度的；謙虛的","s":"The new rule brought only a ________ improvement in reading scores, but teachers hope it will grow over time.","zh":"新規定只帶來些微的閱讀成績進步，但老師們希望它會隨時間擴大。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"些微的"},{"w":"myopic","pos":"adj.","def":"not thinking about the future","cn":"短視的","s":"Cutting the library budget is a ________ decision, because reading skills affect every other subject.","zh":"刪減圖書館預算是短視的決定，因為閱讀能力會影響其他每一科。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"短視的"},{"w":"naive","pos":"adj.","def":"lacking experience and too ready to believe things","cn":"天真的","s":"It is ________ to believe everything you read online, so students must learn to check sources.","zh":"相信網路上讀到的每件事是很天真的，所以學生必須學會查證來源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"天真的"},{"w":"negligent","pos":"adj.","def":"not taking enough care","cn":"疏忽的；失職的","s":"The school was found ________ after a student was hurt in the lab, because no teacher was watching.","zh":"一名學生在實驗室受傷後，學校被認定疏失，因為當時沒有老師在場看管。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"疏失"},{"w":"nominal","pos":"adj.","def":"very small, much less than the real value","cn":"象徵性的；極少的","s":"The museum charges students only a ________ fee, so whole classes can visit on school trips.","zh":"博物館只向學生收取象徵性的費用，所以整班都能在校外教學時參觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"象徵性的"},{"w":"onerous","pos":"adj.","def":"difficult and heavy to deal with","cn":"繁重的","s":"The ________ paperwork for studying abroad took her weeks, but her visa finally arrived in July.","zh":"出國留學的繁重文件花了她好幾週，但她的簽證終於在七月寄到了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"繁重"},{"w":"opaque","pos":"adj.","def":"difficult to understand; not clear","cn":"不透明的；難懂的","s":"The scoring system was ________, so parents asked the school to explain how the results were calculated.","zh":"評分制度不透明，所以家長要求學校說明成績是如何計算的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"不透明"},{"w":"ostensibly","pos":"adv.","def":"seeming to be true, but perhaps not really","cn":"表面上","s":"The new test is ________ about creativity, but many students say it still rewards memorising answers.","zh":"新測驗表面上是考創造力，但許多學生說它仍然獎勵背答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"表面上"},{"w":"outmoded","pos":"adj.","def":"no longer fashionable or useful","cn":"過時的","s":"Some teaching methods are ________, so the government is training teachers to use more discussion in class.","zh":"有些教學方法已經過時，所以政府正在訓練老師在課堂上多採用討論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"過時"},{"w":"overhaul","pos":"v.","def":"to change a system completely to improve it","cn":"徹底檢修；全面改革","s":"The ministry plans to ________ the exam system, but teachers want more time to prepare for the changes.","zh":"教育部計畫全面改革考試制度，但老師們希望有更多時間準備這些改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"全面改革"},{"w":"oversee","pos":"v.","def":"to watch and organise work to check it is done well","cn":"監督；督導","s":"A senior teacher will ________ the science fair, so every project is checked for safety first.","zh":"一位資深老師將督導科展，所以每件作品都會先接受安全檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"督導"},{"w":"peculiar","pos":"adj.","def":"strange or unusual","cn":"奇怪的；特殊的","s":"The new student had a ________ habit of reading while walking, and he once walked into a door.","zh":"那位新同學有邊走路邊看書的奇怪習慣，有一次還撞上了門。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"奇怪"},{"w":"perplex","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone confused","cn":"使困惑","s":"The last question ________ most students, because it used a word that nobody had seen before.","zh":"最後一題讓大部分學生很困惑，因為它用了一個沒人見過的字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"讓 很困惑"},{"w":"plethora","pos":"n.","def":"a very large amount, often too much","cn":"過多；大量","s":"There is a ________ of learning apps online, so it is hard for parents to choose the best one.","zh":"網路上有大量學習應用程式，所以家長很難選出最好的一個。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"大量"},{"w":"polarise","pos":"v.","def":"to divide people into two opposing groups","cn":"使兩極化","s":"The debate about school uniforms tends to ________ parents, because some see them as fair and others as old-fashioned.","zh":"關於校服的爭論往往使家長意見兩極化，因為有些人認為它公平，有些人認為它過時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"使 兩極化"},{"w":"postulate","pos":"v.","def":"to suggest an idea as a basis for a theory","cn":"假定；提出（理論）","s":"Some researchers ________ that bilingual children solve problems faster, but more evidence is needed before schools change.","zh":"有些研究者假定雙語兒童解決問題更快，但在學校做出改變之前，仍需要更多證據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"假定"},{"w":"precedent","pos":"n.","def":"an earlier event used as an example for later decisions","cn":"先例","s":"Letting one student retake the test would set a ________, so the teacher refused all similar requests.","zh":"讓一位學生重考會開先例，所以老師拒絕了所有類似的要求。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"先例"},{"w":"preconception","pos":"n.","def":"an idea formed before you have enough information","cn":"先入之見；成見","s":"Many people have a ________ that vocational schools are for weak students, but this is often untrue.","zh":"許多人有個成見，認為技職學校是給程度差的學生念的，但這常常不是事實。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"成見"},{"w":"predecessor","pos":"n.","def":"the person who had a job before someone else","cn":"前任","s":"The new principal kept many of her ________ ideas, but she also added a reading hour every morning.","zh":"新校長保留了許多前任校長的想法，但她也增加了每天早上的閱讀時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"前任"},{"w":"premature","pos":"adj.","def":"happening too early","cn":"過早的","s":"It is ________ to judge the new curriculum after one year, so researchers want to wait for more data.","zh":"一年後就評斷新課綱還太早，所以研究者想等更多資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"太早"},{"w":"presuppose","pos":"v.","def":"to assume something is true before you begin","cn":"預先假定；以…為前提","s":"The question ________ that all students have a computer at home, but many families do not own one.","zh":"這個題目預設所有學生家裡都有電腦，但許多家庭並沒有。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"預設"},{"w":"prestigious","pos":"adj.","def":"respected and admired as very good","cn":"有聲望的；名聲顯赫的","s":"She was accepted by a ________ university in London, and her whole family celebrated at a restaurant.","zh":"她被倫敦一所名校錄取，全家人在餐廳慶祝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"名校"},{"w":"propagate","pos":"v.","def":"to spread ideas or beliefs to many people","cn":"傳播；宣揚","s":"Social media can ________ false ideas about learning, so teachers explain what the research really says.","zh":"社群媒體可能散播關於學習的錯誤觀念，所以老師會解釋研究真正的結論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"散播"},{"w":"propel","pos":"v.","def":"to push or drive someone forward","cn":"推動；推進","s":"Winning the science contest ________ her into the national team, and she later studied physics abroad.","zh":"贏得科學競賽推動她進入國家隊，她後來出國攻讀物理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"推動"},{"w":"prospective","pos":"adj.","def":"expected to become something in the future","cn":"未來的；預期的","s":"The university held an open day for ________ students, and they toured the labs and dormitories.","zh":"大學為未來的學生舉辦了開放日，他們參觀了實驗室和宿舍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"未來的"},{"w":"punitive","pos":"adj.","def":"intended as punishment","cn":"懲罰性的","s":"Many experts say ________ rules do not stop bullying, so schools should also teach empathy and kindness.","zh":"許多專家說懲罰性的規定無法阻止霸凌，所以學校也應該教導同理心和善良。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"懲罰性的"},{"w":"quintessential","pos":"adj.","def":"being the most typical example of something","cn":"典型的；精髓的","s":"Night markets are a ________ part of Taiwanese life, so exchange students always ask to visit one.","zh":"夜市是台灣生活最典型的一部分，所以交換學生總是要求去逛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"最典型的"},{"w":"reform","pos":"n.","def":"a change made to improve a system","cn":"改革","s":"The education ________ gave students more elective courses, but some parents worry about university entrance.","zh":"這次教育改革給了學生更多選修課，但有些家長擔心升大學的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"改革"},{"w":"relegate","pos":"v.","def":"to move someone or something to a less important position","cn":"降級；貶至次要地位","s":"Many schools ________ art and music to one hour a week, because they focus on exam subjects.","zh":"許多學校把美術和音樂降為每週一小時，因為他們專注在考試科目上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"降"},{"w":"sanction","pos":"n.","def":"official permission or approval","cn":"批准；認可","s":"The club cannot hold the overnight event without the school's ________, so the leaders wrote a formal request.","zh":"沒有學校的批准，社團不能舉辦過夜活動，所以幹部寫了正式申請。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"批准"},{"w":"seminal","pos":"adj.","def":"very important and influencing later work","cn":"開創性的；影響深遠的","s":"Her ________ research on how children learn to read changed teaching methods around the world.","zh":"她關於兒童如何學習閱讀的開創性研究改變了全世界的教學方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"開創性"},{"w":"solicit","pos":"v.","def":"to ask for something such as money or opinions","cn":"徵求；請求","s":"The principal ________ ideas from students about the new canteen menu, and she received over five hundred replies.","zh":"校長向學生徵求新餐廳菜單的點子，並收到超過五百份回覆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"徵求"},{"w":"streamline","pos":"v.","def":"to make a system simpler and more efficient","cn":"精簡；使更有效率","s":"The university wants to ________ its application process, so students will fill in one online form instead of five.","zh":"大學想簡化申請流程，所以學生只需填寫一份線上表格而不是五份。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"簡化"},{"w":"supersede","pos":"v.","def":"to replace something older or less useful","cn":"取代","s":"Tablets have not completely ________ paper books, and many students still prefer printed pages for long reading.","zh":"平板電腦並沒有完全取代紙本書，許多學生長篇閱讀時仍偏好印刷書頁。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"取代"},{"w":"tacit","pos":"adj.","def":"understood without being said","cn":"心照不宣的；默許的","s":"There was a ________ agreement that nobody would talk during the reading hour, so the room was completely silent.","zh":"大家有個心照不宣的共識，閱讀時間沒有人說話，所以教室裡一片寂靜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"心照不宣的"},{"w":"tenet","pos":"n.","def":"a main principle or belief","cn":"原則；信條","s":"A key ________ of the school is respect for others, and teachers remind students of it every day.","zh":"這所學校的一項重要信條是尊重他人，老師每天都提醒學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"信條"},{"w":"transcend","pos":"v.","def":"to go beyond the usual limits of something","cn":"超越","s":"Music can ________ language barriers, so the international students soon sang together in the school choir.","zh":"音樂能超越語言障礙，所以國際學生很快就在學校合唱團裡一起唱歌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"超越"},{"w":"underpin","pos":"v.","def":"to give strong support to an idea or system","cn":"支撐；作為…的基礎","s":"Strong reading skills ________ success in every subject, so the school gives extra help to weak readers.","zh":"紮實的閱讀能力是各科成功的基礎，所以學校給閱讀較弱的學生額外協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"是 基礎"},{"w":"utilitarian","pos":"adj.","def":"designed to be useful rather than beautiful","cn":"實用的；功利的","s":"The old classroom was ________ and grey, but the students decorated it with posters and plants.","zh":"那間舊教室只講實用又灰暗，但學生們用海報和植物把它佈置起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"只講實用"},{"w":"venerable","pos":"adj.","def":"respected because of age or experience","cn":"德高望重的；歷史悠久的","s":"The ________ school celebrated its hundredth birthday, and former students came back from all over the world.","zh":"這所歷史悠久的學校慶祝百年校慶，校友們從世界各地回來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"歷史悠久的"},{"w":"vindicate","pos":"v.","def":"to prove that someone was right","cn":"證明…是正確的","s":"The excellent results ________ the teacher's new method, so other schools now want to try it too.","zh":"優異的成績證明這位老師的新方法是對的，所以其他學校現在也想嘗試。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"證明 是對的"},{"w":"wholesome","pos":"adj.","def":"good for your health or your moral character","cn":"有益身心的","s":"The school serves ________ lunches with rice, vegetables and fish, and fried food is only offered once a week.","zh":"學校供應米飯、蔬菜和魚等有益健康的午餐，而油炸食物一週只提供一次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"有益健康的"},{"w":"zealous","pos":"adj.","def":"very enthusiastic and eager","cn":"熱心的；狂熱的","s":"The ________ volunteers arrived early to set up the book fair, and they stayed until every box was packed.","zh":"熱心的志工們提早到場佈置書展，一直留到每個箱子都打包好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"熱心的"},{"w":"spur","pos":"v.","def":"to encourage someone to do something","cn":"激勵；鞭策","s":"Her teacher's kind words ________ her to enter the writing contest, and she won second place.","zh":"老師親切的話語激勵她參加寫作比賽，結果她得了第二名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"激勵"},{"w":"bestow","pos":"v.","def":"to give an honour or gift to someone","cn":"授予；贈予","s":"The university ________ an honorary degree on the famous writer, and she gave a moving speech to graduates.","zh":"大學授予這位知名作家榮譽學位，她向畢業生發表了動人的演講。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"授予"},{"w":"benevolent","pos":"adj.","def":"kind and wanting to help others","cn":"仁慈的；慈善的","s":"A ________ businessman paid for the new school bus, so children in the mountains no longer walk for hours.","zh":"一位慈善的商人出資購買新校車，所以山區的孩子不必再走好幾個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"慈善的"},{"w":"circumspect","pos":"adj.","def":"careful not to take risks","cn":"謹慎的","s":"Be ________ about what you post online, because some universities sometimes check applicants' social media accounts.","zh":"在網路上發文要謹慎，因為有些大學有時會查看申請者的社群媒體帳號。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"謹慎"},{"w":"cumbersome","pos":"adj.","def":"large, heavy or complicated and difficult to use","cn":"笨重的；繁瑣的","s":"The old registration system was ________, so students waited in long lines for hours every semester.","zh":"舊的選課系統很繁瑣，所以學生每學期都要排好幾個小時的長隊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"繁瑣"},{"w":"dissuade","pos":"v.","def":"to persuade someone not to do something","cn":"勸阻","s":"Her parents tried to ________ her from studying drama, but she followed her dream and became an actor.","zh":"她父母試圖勸阻她念戲劇，但她追隨夢想成為了演員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"勸阻"},{"w":"enigma","pos":"n.","def":"a person or thing that is mysterious and hard to understand","cn":"謎；難以理解的人或事","s":"The quiet new student was an ________ to his classmates, but they discovered he was a brilliant guitarist.","zh":"那位安靜的新同學對同學們來說是個謎，但他們發現他是個出色的吉他手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"謎"},{"w":"epitomise","pos":"v.","def":"to be a perfect example of something","cn":"是…的典型；集中體現","s":"Our coach ________ hard work, because she trains every morning and never misses a practice.","zh":"我們的教練是努力的典範，因為她每天早上訓練，從不缺席任何一次練習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"典範"},{"w":"exhort","pos":"v.","def":"to strongly encourage someone to do something","cn":"力勸；勉勵","s":"The principal ________ the graduates to keep learning, and she reminded them that education never ends.","zh":"校長勉勵畢業生持續學習，並提醒他們教育永無止境。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"勉勵"},{"w":"extol","pos":"v.","def":"to praise something very highly","cn":"讚揚；頌揚","s":"Many parents ________ the benefits of reading aloud, because their children learned new words quickly this way.","zh":"許多家長讚揚朗讀的好處，因為他們的孩子用這種方式很快學會新單字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"讚揚"},{"w":"fastidious","pos":"adj.","def":"very careful about details and wanting things perfect","cn":"一絲不苟的；挑剔的","s":"Our ________ chemistry teacher checks every measurement, so our lab reports must be very accurate.","zh":"我們那位一絲不苟的化學老師會檢查每一個測量值，所以我們的實驗報告必須非常精確。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"一絲不苟的"},{"w":"heterogeneous","pos":"adj.","def":"made up of many different kinds","cn":"異質的；多樣混雜的","s":"The class is very ________, and it includes students from five countries with very different levels of English.","zh":"這個班級非常多元混雜，包括來自五個國家、英文程度差異很大的學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"多元混雜"},{"w":"impeccable","pos":"adj.","def":"perfect, with no mistakes","cn":"無可挑剔的；完美的","s":"Her English pronunciation is ________, so many people think she grew up in an English-speaking country.","zh":"她的英文發音無可挑剔，所以很多人以為她在英語系國家長大。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"無可挑剔"},{"w":"impromptu","pos":"adj.","def":"done without planning or preparation","cn":"即興的；臨時的","s":"The teacher asked me to give an ________ speech, but I felt ready because we practise speaking every week.","zh":"老師要我做即興演講，但我覺得已經準備好了，因為我們每週都練習口說。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"即興"},{"w":"incisive","pos":"adj.","def":"clear, sharp and showing deep understanding","cn":"敏銳的；一針見血的","s":"His ________ questions impressed the professor, and she invited him to join her research team.","zh":"他一針見血的提問讓教授印象深刻，她邀請他加入研究團隊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"一針見血的"},{"w":"innocuous","pos":"adj.","def":"not harmful or offensive","cn":"無害的；無惡意的","s":"The joke seemed ________ to him, but it hurt his classmate's feelings, so he apologised the next day.","zh":"這個玩笑對他來說似乎無傷大雅，但它傷了同學的心，所以他隔天道了歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"無傷大雅"},{"w":"insular","pos":"adj.","def":"interested only in your own small group or country","cn":"狹隘的；封閉的","s":"Students from ________ communities may struggle abroad at first, but travel soon widens their view of the world.","zh":"來自封閉社群的學生一開始在國外可能適應困難，但旅行很快就會拓展他們的世界觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"封閉"},{"w":"intrepid","pos":"adj.","def":"brave and not afraid of danger","cn":"無畏的；勇敢的","s":"The ________ students hiked to a remote village to teach English, and they stayed there for the whole summer.","zh":"這群勇敢的學生徒步到偏遠村莊教英文，並在那裡待了一整個暑假。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"勇敢的"},{"w":"nascent","pos":"adj.","def":"just starting to develop","cn":"新生的；初期的","s":"AI tutoring is still a ________ industry, so nobody knows how much it will change schools.","zh":"人工智慧家教仍是新興的產業，所以沒有人知道它會改變學校多少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"新興的"},{"w":"obstinate","pos":"adj.","def":"refusing to change your opinion","cn":"固執的","s":"He was too ________ to accept help with maths, so his grades did not improve until he finally asked.","zh":"他太固執了，不肯接受數學方面的幫助，所以直到他終於開口求助，成績才進步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"固執"},{"w":"ostracise","pos":"v.","def":"to refuse to include someone in a group","cn":"排擠；排斥","s":"Some children ________ classmates who look different, so teachers must teach respect from an early age.","zh":"有些孩子會排擠外表不同的同學，所以老師必須從小教導尊重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"排擠"},{"w":"paucity","pos":"n.","def":"a lack of something","cn":"缺乏；不足","s":"There is a ________ of English teachers in rural areas, so many students there learn through online classes.","zh":"偏鄉地區英文老師不足，所以那裡許多學生透過線上課程學習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"不足"},{"w":"penchant","pos":"n.","def":"a strong liking for something","cn":"嗜好；偏好","s":"She has a ________ for long words in her essays, but her teacher wants her to write more simply.","zh":"她寫作文時偏好用長字，但老師希望她寫得簡單一點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"偏好"},{"w":"perfunctory","pos":"adj.","def":"done quickly with little care or interest","cn":"敷衍的","s":"He gave a ________ apology to the teacher, so she asked him to think again about what he had done.","zh":"他向老師做了敷衍的道歉，所以她要他再想想自己做了什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"敷衍的"},{"w":"prowess","pos":"n.","def":"great skill at doing something","cn":"高超技能；本領","s":"Her ________ in mathematics was clear from an early age, and she won her first contest at nine.","zh":"她在數學上的過人本領從小就很明顯，九歲就贏得了第一場比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"過人本領"},{"w":"reprimand","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone officially that they did wrong","cn":"斥責；訓誡","s":"The teacher ________ the boys for running in the hallway, but she did it quietly and kindly.","zh":"老師訓誡那些在走廊奔跑的男孩，但她說得很小聲也很和善。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"訓誡"},{"w":"reticent","pos":"adj.","def":"not willing to say what you think or feel","cn":"沉默寡言的；不願多說的","s":"Many students are ________ in large classes, but they speak much more in small group discussions.","zh":"許多學生在大班級裡不太願意發言，但在小組討論時說得多很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"不太願意發言"},{"w":"rhetoric","pos":"n.","def":"speech or writing meant to persuade, sometimes without real meaning","cn":"修辭；空話","s":"Politicians use a lot of ________ about better schools, but teachers want to see real money and action.","zh":"政客們發表許多關於改善學校的漂亮話，但老師想看到真正的經費和行動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"漂亮話"},{"w":"squander","pos":"v.","def":"to waste money, time or chances","cn":"浪費；揮霍","s":"Don't ________ your free periods on games, because those hours can make a big difference before exams.","zh":"別把空堂時間浪費在玩遊戲上，因為那些時間在考前可能帶來很大的差別。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"浪費"},{"w":"wary","pos":"adj.","def":"careful because you think there may be danger or problems","cn":"謹慎的；提防的","s":"Parents are ________ of new learning apps, because some of them collect children's personal data.","zh":"家長對新的學習應用程式很提防，因為其中有些會蒐集兒童的個人資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"很提防"},{"w":"redress","pos":"v.","def":"to correct something unfair","cn":"糾正；補救","s":"The government built new schools in rural areas to ________ the gap, but good teachers are still hard to find.","zh":"政府在鄉村地區興建新學校以弭平差距，但優秀的老師仍然難找。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"弭平"},{"w":"hit the books","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start studying hard","cn":"開始用功讀書","s":"The final exams start next week, so I need to ______ ______ ______ instead of going to the cinema tonight.","zh":"期末考下週開始，所以我今晚得開始用功讀書，而不是去看電影。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"開始用功讀書"},{"w":"learn by heart","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to memorise something so you can say it perfectly","cn":"背熟；牢記","s":"We had to ______ ______ ______ a short poem, and each student recited it in front of the class.","zh":"我們必須背熟一首短詩，而且每位學生都要在全班面前背誦。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"背熟"},{"w":"pass with flying colours","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to pass a test very successfully","cn":"以優異成績通過","s":"She was nervous about the speaking test, but she ______ ______ ______ ______ and got the highest score in her class.","zh":"她對口說測驗很緊張，但她以優異成績通過，拿到班上最高分。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"以優異成績通過"},{"w":"teacher's pet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a student whom the teacher seems to like best","cn":"老師的寵兒","s":"Some classmates call him the ______ ______, but he simply works hard and asks good questions.","zh":"有些同學叫他老師的寵兒，但他只是很努力又會問好問題。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"老師的寵兒"},{"w":"brush up on","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to practise and improve a skill you used to have","cn":"複習；重溫","s":"I need to ______ ______ ______ my Japanese before the trip, because I have forgotten many useful phrases.","zh":"出發前我需要複習一下日文，因為我忘了很多實用的句子。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"複習一下"},{"w":"show of hands","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a vote where people raise their hands","cn":"舉手表決","s":"The teacher asked for a ______ ______ ______, and most students chose to go to the science museum.","zh":"老師請大家舉手表決，大部分學生選擇去科學博物館。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"舉手表決"},{"w":"trial and error","pos":"n.phr.","def":"trying different ways until you find one that works","cn":"反覆試驗；試誤","s":"We built the bridge model by ______ ______ ______, and it finally held two kilograms after five attempts.","zh":"我們用反覆試驗的方式做橋梁模型，試了五次後它終於撐住了兩公斤。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"反覆試驗"},{"w":"jot down","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to write something quickly","cn":"匆匆記下","s":"Please ______ ______ any new words during the video, and we will check their meanings together afterwards.","zh":"請在看影片時記下任何生字，之後我們會一起查它們的意思。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"記下"},{"w":"look up","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to search for information in a book or online","cn":"查詢（字典等）","s":"When I find a new word, I ______ ______ its meaning, and then I write an example sentence in my notebook.","zh":"我遇到生字時會查它的意思，然後在筆記本上寫一個例句。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"查"},{"w":"read between the lines","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to understand a hidden meaning","cn":"領會言外之意","s":"The question asks you to ______ ______ ______ ______, because the writer never says directly how she feels.","zh":"這題要你讀出言外之意，因為作者從未直接說出她的感受。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"讀出言外之意"},{"w":"growth mindset","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the belief that ability can grow with effort","cn":"成長型思維","s":"Teachers try to build a ______ ______ in students, so they see mistakes as chances to learn rather than signs of failure.","zh":"老師們試著培養學生的成長型思維，讓他們把錯誤視為學習的機會，而不是失敗的象徵。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"成長型思維"},{"w":"practice makes perfect","pos":"phr.","def":"doing something often is the way to become good at it","cn":"熟能生巧","s":"My piano teacher always says \"______ ______ ______\", so I play for thirty minutes every day.","zh":"我的鋼琴老師總是說「熟能生巧」，所以我每天彈三十分鐘。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"熟能生巧"},{"w":"hand in","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to give your work to a teacher","cn":"繳交","s":"Please ______ ______ your reports by Friday, or the teacher will take ten points off your score.","zh":"請在星期五前繳交報告，否則老師會扣十分。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"繳交"},{"w":"keep up with","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to move or learn at the same speed as others","cn":"跟上","s":"He missed two weeks of school, so it was hard to ______ ______ ______ the rest of the class.","zh":"他缺課兩週，所以很難跟上班上其他同學。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"跟上"},{"w":"get the hang of","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to learn how to do something","cn":"掌握訣竅；學會","s":"Coding seemed impossible at first, but I ______ ______ ______ ______ it after a few weeks of practice.","zh":"一開始寫程式似乎不可能，但練習幾週後我就掌握了訣竅。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"掌握了訣竅"},{"w":"cut corners","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to do something badly to save time or effort","cn":"偷工減料；走捷徑","s":"Don't ______ ______ on your science project, because the judges will check every step of your method.","zh":"做科學專題別偷工減料，因為評審會檢查你方法中的每一個步驟。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"偷工減料"},{"w":"pay attention to","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to listen or watch carefully","cn":"注意","s":"Please ______ ______ ______ the instructions, because the order of the steps is very important in this experiment.","zh":"請注意操作說明，因為這個實驗中步驟的順序非常重要。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"注意"},{"w":"learn the hard way","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to learn something through a bad experience","cn":"從慘痛經驗中學到","s":"I didn't back up my files, so I ______ ______ ______ ______ when my laptop crashed the night before the deadline.","zh":"我沒有備份檔案，所以截止日前一晚筆電當機時，我從慘痛經驗中學到了教訓。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"從慘痛經驗中學到了教訓"},{"w":"learn from one's mistakes","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to improve by understanding what you did wrong","cn":"從錯誤中學習","s":"Ken failed his first driving test, but he ______ ______ ______ ______ and passed easily the second time.","zh":"肯第一次駕照考試沒過，但他從錯誤中學習，第二次輕鬆通過了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"從錯誤中學習"},{"w":"self-fulfilling prophecy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a belief that makes itself come true","cn":"自我應驗的預言","s":"If teachers expect a student to fail, it can become a ______ ______, because the student may stop trying.","zh":"如果老師預期某位學生會失敗，這可能會成為自我應驗的預言，因為學生可能會放棄努力。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"自我應驗的預言"}]};
